9957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":30071,"downloads":30073,"followers":29985,"categories":30074,"additional_categories":30075,"loaders":30076,"versions":30077,"icon_url":30080,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":30081,"gallery":30082,"color":30083,"thread_id":30084,"monetization_status":30057},"unsupported",[1310,1295,1268,1211,1178,1169,1133,1094,1046,1040,1007,965,959,887,881,844,838,790,787,757,709,667,658,652,607,601,556,502,496,483],"yPDyNjpr","discord-port-plugin","hSvnOMcX","DiscordPort","Bridge your Minecraft server and Discord — two-way chat relay, rich status embeds, account linking, and more.","---\n\n## DiscordPort\n\n**DiscordPort** is a Spigot/Paper plugin that connects your Minecraft server to Discord with zero friction.\n\n### Features\n\n- **Two-way chat relay** — Messages flow between Minecraft and Discord in real time, with player skin avatars via webhook.\n- **Event notifications** — Join, quit, death, advancement, and server start/stop are all relayed to Discord.\n- **Status channels** — Keep voice channel names updated with live player count, TPS, and RAM usage.\n- **Persistent status embed** — A single Discord message that always shows your server's current state. Update it with `/status`.\n- **Account linking** — Players run `/link` in-game, then confirm with `/link \u003Ccode>` on Discord. Optionally enforce linking before joining.\n- **Log channel** — Stream your server console to Discord, and optionally run commands from it.\n- **20 languages** — Language is auto-detected from your OS on first startup.\n- **35+ placeholders** — `{TPS}`, `{ONLINE_PLAYERS}`, `{RAM_USAGE}`, and many more for full customization.\n\n### Compatibility\n\n| Server | Supported |\n|--------|-----------|\n| Paper  | ✅ |\n| Purpur | ✅ |\n| Spigot | ✅ |\n| Folia  | ❌ |\n\n**Minecraft:** 1.18 – 26.x  \n**Java:** 17+\n\n### Setup\n\n**1. Create a Discord Bot**\n- Go to [discord.com/developers/applications](https://discord.com/developers/applications) → **New Application**\n- Open the **Bot** tab → **Add Bot** → **Reset Token** → copy the token\n\n**2. Enable Intents**\n- On the **Bot** tab, enable **Server Members Intent** and **Message Content Intent** → **Save Changes**\n\n**3. Invite the Bot**\n- Go to **OAuth2 → URL Generator** → check `bot` + `applications.commands`\n- Permissions: `Send Messages`, `Read Message History`, `Manage Webhooks`, `Manage Channels`\n- Open the generated URL in your browser and invite the bot to your server\n\n**4. Get IDs**\n- Enable **Developer Mode** in Discord settings\n- Right-click your server icon → **Copy Server ID** → paste as `bot.guild_id`\n- Right-click your text channel → **Copy Channel ID** → paste as the route `id`\n\n**5. Configure & Start**\n- Drop the JAR into `plugins/`, start the server — `plugins/DiscordPort/config.yml` is generated\n- Fill in `bot.token`, `bot.guild_id`, and your channel IDs, then restart\n\n---\n\n**DiscordPort** は、MinecraftサーバーとDiscordをシームレスに繋ぐ Spigot/Paper プラグインです。\n\n### 機能一覧\n\n- **双方向チャット中継** — MinecraftとDiscordのメッセージをリアルタイムで相互転送。Webhookでプレイヤーのスキンをアイコンとして表示。\n- **イベント通知** — 参加・退出・死亡・進捗解除・サーバー起動/停止をDiscordに通知。\n- **ステータスチャンネル** — ボイスチャンネルの名前をプレイヤー数・TPS・RAM使用量でリアルタイム更新。\n- **永続ステータス埋め込み** — サーバーの現状を常に表示し続けるDiscordメッセージ。`/status` で設置。\n- **アカウント連携** — ゲーム内で `/link` → Discordで `/link \u003Cコード>` で連携完了。連携必須モードにも対応。\n- **ログチャンネル** — サーバーコンソールをDiscordへストリーミング。Discordからコマンド実行も可能。\n- **20言語対応** — 初回起動時にOSから言語を自動検出。\n- **35種以上のプレースホルダー** — `{TPS}`, `{ONLINE_PLAYERS}`, `{RAM_USAGE}` など、メッセージを自由にカスタマイズ。\n\n### 対応環境\n\n| サーバー | 対応 |\n|--------|------|\n| Paper  | ✅ |\n| Purpur | ✅ |\n| Spigot | ✅ |\n| Folia  | ❌ |\n\n**Minecraft:** 1.18 〜 26.x  \n**Java:** 17以上\n\n### 導入手順\n\n**1. Discord Botを作成する**\n- [discord.com/developers/applications](https://discord.com/developers/applications) → **New Application**\n- **Bot** タブ → **Add Bot** → **Reset Token** → トークンをコピー\n\n**2. Intentsを有効にする**\n- **Bot** タブ → **Server Members Intent** と **Message Content Intent** を ON → **Save Changes**\n\n**3. Botを招待する**\n- **OAuth2 → URL Generator** → `bot` + `applications.commands` にチェック\n- 権限: `Send Messages`、`Read Message History`、`Manage Webhooks`、`Manage Channels`\n- 生成URLをブラウザで開いてサーバーに招待\n\n**4. IDを取得する**\n- Discord設定 → 詳細設定 → **開発者モード** を ON\n- サーバーアイコンを右クリック → **IDをコピー** → `bot.guild_id` に貼り付け\n- テキストチャンネルを右クリック → **IDをコピー** → ルートの `id` に貼り付け\n\n**5. 設定して起動**\n- JARを `plugins/` に入れてサーバーを起動 → `plugins/DiscordPort/config.yml` が自動生成\n- `bot.token`、`bot.guild_id`、チャンネルIDを記入して再起動","2026-05-30T06:43:47.056588Z","2026-06-01T09:27:55.780290Z","2026-06-06T03:42:41.711668Z","2026-06-04T09:49:36.170032Z",{"id":30072,"name":10,"url":3589},"LicenseRef-All-Rights-Reserved",17,[275],[134,175,288],[329,350,401,405,417],[30078,30079],"5czqvJcb","OEDPLN46","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPDyNjpr/96aaad4637152b0338388b5e4283242f370ca5e6_96.webp",[],[],4933918,"KPmfmHZB",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":30059,"game_versions":30086,"id":30087,"slug":30088,"project_type":12,"team":30089,"organization":3589,"title":30090,"description":30091,"body":30092,"body_url":3589,"published":30093,"updated":30094,"approved":30095,"queued":30096,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":30097,"downloads":30098,"followers":30001,"categories":30099,"additional_categories":30100,"loaders":30101,"versions":30102,"icon_url":30106,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":30107,"gallery":30108,"color":30117,"thread_id":30118,"monetization_status":30057},[2168,2162,2159,2102,2093,2084,1505,1499,1487,1466,652],"yPxTETA3","compact-fire","arhjAgCp","Compact Fire","Compact Fire is a resource pack that significantly reduces the flame effect that covers your screen when you burn. This allows you to maintain clear vision and move more easily, especially in combat situations.","\nAre you tired of the fire overlay that completely covers your screen when you catch fire in Minecraft? The Compact Fire resource pack is designed to solve exactly that problem. This simple and useful pack significantly reduces the size and intensity of the fire overlay.\n\nWith this pack, your field of view stays clearer even when you're on fire. This allows you to see your surroundings clearly and fight enemies more comfortably when they set you on fire or when you get too close to a fire source. Compact Fire makes your Minecraft experience less distracting and more functional.\n\nInstallation is very simple. Just place the downloaded .zip file into your resourcepacks folder, which you can access from the Minecraft main menu by going to Options > Resource Packs > Open Pack Folder. Once you enable the pack, you will see the changes instantly.\n\nI hope Compact Fire makes your Minecraft adventure more enjoyable and less confusing!","2025-08-11T21:19:02.132966Z","2025-08-12T13:26:31.292458Z","2025-08-16T04:49:01.413946Z","2025-08-15T11:28:38.175050Z",{"id":30072,"name":10,"url":3589},803,[15,139,300],[307],[377],[30103,30104,30105],"NPTgihDA","T15VgNhd","2LNIKgVu","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPxTETA3/70ea657c97723b7ddabf3661a2a44e214cb328bc.png",[],[30109,30113],{"url":30110,"raw_url":30111,"featured":439,"title":3589,"description":3589,"created":30112,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPxTETA3/images/95d5314cddecb56904b57e320f5fc4559a3438a6_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPxTETA3/images/95d5314cddecb56904b57e320f5fc4559a3438a6.png","2025-08-11T21:21:33.762647Z",{"url":30114,"raw_url":30115,"featured":439,"title":3589,"description":3589,"created":30116,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPxTETA3/images/c270152497e69d2597d515e5ce6ec4c433d51465_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPxTETA3/images/c270152497e69d2597d515e5ce6ec4c433d51465.png","2025-08-11T21:21:18.922214Z",13531146,"qL80nsCO",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":30120,"id":30121,"slug":30122,"project_type":31,"team":30123,"organization":3589,"title":30124,"description":30125,"body":30126,"body_url":3589,"published":30127,"updated":30128,"approved":30127,"queued":3589,"status":29957,"requested_status":3589,"moderator_message":3589,"license":30129,"downloads":30130,"followers":30131,"categories":30132,"additional_categories":30133,"loaders":30134,"versions":30135,"icon_url":30140,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":30141,"gallery":30142,"color":30143,"thread_id":30121,"monetization_status":30057},[1295,1268,1211,1169,1094],"yPfMvUxc","better_shields","FwZ2tgdm","Better Shields","Speeds up shields ","Fabric mod changing the tick delay on shields from 5 to 0 to make them much faster and usable","2022-04-06T14:13:23.990721Z","2023-04-23T07:45:46.359969Z",{"id":29982,"name":29983,"url":3589},2188,11,[115,134,303],[],[346],[30136,30137,30138,30139],"Kfe9Rklu","LVtCqTyT","cHTgJO6K","L4A1MjjY","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPfMvUxc/7254057f2e5da6e1d909c8f712468c03f0fc980e_96.webp",[],[],5122840,{"client_side":29969,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":30145,"id":30146,"slug":30147,"project_type":31,"team":30148,"organization":3589,"title":30149,"description":30150,"body":30151,"body_url":3589,"published":30152,"updated":30153,"approved":30154,"queued":30155,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":30156,"downloads":30157,"followers":30158,"categories":30159,"additional_categories":30160,"loaders":30161,"versions":30162,"icon_url":30164,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":30165,"gallery":30166,"color":30179,"thread_id":30180,"monetization_status":30057},[838,790,787,757],"yPE18IpQ","refused-features","8HJYGTmr","Refused Features","A mod that adds features that were refused by Mojang but the game definitely needs.","# Refused Features \n\nThis mod introduces several unique additions to Minecraft: vertical slabs, a shotgun, a duck, and a ring.  \n\n## The Ring  \nThe ring allows you to \"marry\" a villager and will spawn a child as a result.  \n\n![A player approaching a villager with a ring in hand.](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/878d18efad19f27d1ab653cca006aac6de94cdec.jpeg)  \n\n## Vertical Slabs  \nFinally, vertical slabs are here! Build creatively with this long-awaited feature.  \n\n![A vertical slab in Minecraft.](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b2330c9c27447bceaa1e2da3f55a1d4f6fd93121.jpeg)  \n\n## The Shotgun  \nDespite Mojang's reluctance, this mod introduces a firearm into Minecraft. \n\n![A shotgun in Minecraft held by the player.](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eba529d5a4883b2ac29dd4ac8aab44228cb00d88.jpeg)  \n\n## Watch the Creation  \nThis mod was created in the following video:  \n\n\u003Ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/ktGdzjpADto\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen>\u003C/iframe>\n","2024-12-09T22:14:17.550928Z","2024-12-10T20:24:36.729211Z","2024-12-15T07:19:21.593829Z","2024-12-13T07:19:35.716864Z",{"id":29982,"name":29983,"url":3589},925,7,[303],[],[385],[30163],"Vk6AntXm","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPE18IpQ/82c012fd3115bbfa5ba341bfa67776ec04d61062_96.webp",[],[30167,30173],{"url":30168,"raw_url":30169,"featured":846,"title":30170,"description":30171,"created":30172,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPE18IpQ/images/37fd07fed48d2e495ede9ad3757f805734af1568_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPE18IpQ/images/37fd07fed48d2e495ede9ad3757f805734af1568.png","Dalles verticales","Enfin dans Minecraft...","2024-12-10T20:30:46.205589Z",{"url":30174,"raw_url":30175,"featured":439,"title":30176,"description":30177,"created":30178,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPE18IpQ/images/878d18efad19f27d1ab653cca006aac6de94cdec_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPE18IpQ/images/878d18efad19f27d1ab653cca006aac6de94cdec.jpeg","Bague de marriage","Vous pouvez épousez des villageois. A peu près.","2024-12-10T20:30:18.843718Z",4601890,"AMtStcAD",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":30182,"id":30183,"slug":30184,"project_type":34,"team":30185,"organization":3589,"title":30186,"description":30187,"body":30188,"body_url":3589,"published":30189,"updated":30190,"approved":30191,"queued":30192,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":30193,"downloads":30194,"followers":29985,"categories":30195,"additional_categories":30196,"loaders":30197,"versions":30198,"icon_url":30213,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":30214,"gallery":30215,"color":30236,"thread_id":30237,"monetization_status":30057},[1040],"yPerymAN","gun-n-craft","oDlL7bt2","Gun n craft","Turns minecraft into a shooting game","**Gun n craft** is a gun based mosdpack that fully is revolved around guns\n\nIf you have not gotten a starting weapon use the following command:  \n**/starterkit choose \"desired gun\"**\n\nYou will start off with a weapon of choice and is recomended to keep any pistol type because they stay even after death\n\nNot only will you be equiped, but most of the mobs will also have the arrange of guns you could use\n\nInstead of potions and brewing stand there are now wearable items and charms that give some of the old potion effects and new effects\n\nSleeping has been completley disabled and spawn points have been switched to be with campfires\n\n**THE MODPACK IS VERY EARLY AND LACKS MANY FEATURES, UNWANTED MODS, AND HAS BUGS**","2025-08-17T04:38:50.804588Z","2026-04-19T23:12:50.613386Z","2025-09-08T14:55:22.503415Z","2025-08-23T17:06:25.533084Z",{"id":30072,"name":10,"url":3589},40620,[30,69,200],[77],[354],[30199,30200,30201,30202,30203,30204,30205,30206,30207,30208,30209,30210,30211,30212],"NSlQCPFx","Vt35q6X6","WEkMGpUm","eY7xGQwW","AN008V0X","koglHe46","7tijzmri","6PR9yINH","ApzA57Vn","DYpe7kH1","MtdFe2ps","ic2lSUQF","czSDGEXE","VaQqH6Ng","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPerymAN/9ce06d7060770f99fdce1658cae175e00e2b77ba.jpeg",[],[30216,30220,30224,30228,30232],{"url":30217,"raw_url":30218,"featured":439,"title":3589,"description":3589,"created":30219,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPerymAN/images/276ad6dfe76d0fe989443b6d5887e112a8a6c712_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPerymAN/images/276ad6dfe76d0fe989443b6d5887e112a8a6c712.png","2025-12-28T23:46:39.190906Z",{"url":30221,"raw_url":30222,"featured":439,"title":3589,"description":3589,"created":30223,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPerymAN/images/61ff8cdf405af28f515d19df08d4d94bceba2c4f_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPerymAN/images/61ff8cdf405af28f515d19df08d4d94bceba2c4f.png","2025-12-28T23:46:47.511059Z",{"url":30225,"raw_url":30226,"featured":439,"title":3589,"description":3589,"created":30227,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPerymAN/images/88ab2d0708d1f6c79630761631685608ab98b41f_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPerymAN/images/88ab2d0708d1f6c79630761631685608ab98b41f.png","2025-12-28T23:46:10.236974Z",{"url":30229,"raw_url":30230,"featured":439,"title":3589,"description":3589,"created":30231,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPerymAN/images/a1e2a1e0ca020f1308fcf07d0f4e471b0667d3cf_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPerymAN/images/a1e2a1e0ca020f1308fcf07d0f4e471b0667d3cf.png","2025-12-28T23:46:30.581232Z",{"url":30233,"raw_url":30234,"featured":439,"title":3589,"description":3589,"created":30235,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPerymAN/images/fc07c745328b4befdea93319d65061cf83560f19_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPerymAN/images/fc07c745328b4befdea93319d65061cf83560f19.png","2025-12-28T23:46:23.442670Z",2171687,"g7q1uRzH",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":30239,"id":30240,"slug":30241,"project_type":34,"team":30242,"organization":3589,"title":30243,"description":30244,"body":30245,"body_url":3589,"published":30246,"updated":30247,"approved":30248,"queued":30249,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":30250,"downloads":30251,"followers":30001,"categories":30252,"additional_categories":30253,"loaders":30254,"versions":30255,"icon_url":30257,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":30258,"donation_urls":30259,"gallery":30260,"color":30261,"thread_id":30262,"monetization_status":30057},[1040],"yOqQag0v","creative-liberties","NNMU5OfL","Creative Liberties","A Create-focused pack with some adventures on the side. Meant to help learn Create while also being a long-term chill pack.","Creative Liberties is a passion project modpack that I wanted to make to help me learn how to work with Create after playing other modpacks my friends have made that also featured the mod. Its primary focus is to help ease others into using Create while also functioning as a chilled out relax pack with low stress and plenty of ways to kick back and relax with friends.\n\nSome highlights include:\n- Create, as well as a few addons\n- YUNG's suite of structure improvements\n- Tetra's toolcrafting\n- Timeless and Classics Zero with Create Armory\n- Customizable Player Models and Cosmetic Armors\n- Artifacts and Relics\n\n\n\nCosmetic Armor Reworked is a mod by LainMi found [here](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmetic-armor-reworked).","2025-04-27T15:57:05.915032Z","2025-04-27T17:16:29.573771Z","2025-05-01T04:06:44.001386Z","2025-04-27T17:22:50.607664Z",{"id":29982,"name":29983,"url":3589},210,[162,288],[30,77],[385],[30256],"bxXUq2Nf","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOqQag0v/223b0b203175c21245fd552f9321fe8125af1f12.png","https://discord.gg/J84aNks3Dy",[],[],16481356,"kdudwHCG",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":30059,"game_versions":30264,"id":30265,"slug":30266,"project_type":12,"team":30267,"organization":3589,"title":30268,"description":30269,"body":30270,"body_url":3589,"published":30271,"updated":30272,"approved":30273,"queued":30274,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":30275,"downloads":30276,"followers":30277,"categories":30278,"additional_categories":30279,"loaders":30280,"versions":30281,"icon_url":30290,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":30291,"gallery":30292,"color":30297,"thread_id":30298,"monetization_status":30057},[1538,1535,1505,1499,1487,1466,1391,1373,1310,1295,1268,1211,1178,1169,1133,1094,1046,1040,1007,965,959,887,881,844,838,790,787,757,709,667,658,652,607,601,556,502,496,483],"yPBwDzHA","spawned-eggs","rrjA967j","Spawned Eggs","Replaces spawn egg textures with blocky mob icons.","![A selection of the blocky mob icon spawn egg textures in this resource pack.](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/02df0baff3a7e910b1e292e2e36dd6bd49d59859.png)\n\nReplaces the default spawn eggs with full-body pixel icons of the mobs they summon.\n\nNo more inscrutable recolors or vaguely egg-shaped blobs with unsettling features—each egg is now like a little action figure of its mob, staying true to Minecraft’s blocky style.\n\nThis is an adaptation of the spawn egg textures in my resource pack, [Whimscape](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/whimscape), with changes for a better fit with the Default resource pack and mob designs.\n\n[**Bedrock version on CurseForge**](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/texture-packs/spawned-eggs-bedrock)","2024-10-07T21:26:21.561992Z","2026-04-15T15:24:09.679634Z","2024-10-09T23:18:29.334942Z","2024-10-09T15:54:45.792359Z",{"id":30072,"name":10,"url":3589},200991,430,[15,148],[],[377],[30282,30283,30284,30285,30286,30287,30288,30289],"HAej4IkE","PRWG06IN","4v43Y25J","RCsMSIwW","sabB823l","gSk4Ov0G","bHYR0xFf","HjzdruGS","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPBwDzHA/bc5a017864eaf7a9e6e447a92f2b7974f6919031.png",[],[30293],{"url":30294,"raw_url":30294,"featured":846,"title":30295,"description":3589,"created":30296,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPBwDzHA/images/02df0baff3a7e910b1e292e2e36dd6bd49d59859.png","Spawn Eggs","2025-04-21T20:45:50.727101Z",14715520,"XQhbAfoS",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":30300,"id":30301,"slug":30302,"project_type":31,"team":30303,"organization":3589,"title":30304,"description":30305,"body":30306,"body_url":3589,"published":30307,"updated":30308,"approved":30309,"queued":30310,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":30311,"downloads":30312,"followers":30044,"categories":30313,"additional_categories":30314,"loaders":30315,"versions":30316,"icon_url":30319,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":30320,"gallery":30321,"color":30392,"thread_id":30393,"monetization_status":30057},[1040,838],"yQ1IaptL","monkie-mischief","R6Gw535N","Monkie Mischief","''If these peaches didn't make me inmortal, they'd literally kill me'' -Monkie King, Lego Monkie Kid™","WARNING: Use this mod at your own risk, this is NOT a survival mod, this thing is made for experimental reasons and you can use to play around yourself or to fight your friends, make sure to not use this is a world you care about, since it can be very destructive.\n\nHave you ever wanted to be Sun Wukong and battle your friends that have very op and annoying forge mods that have op gear and stuff that makes them invincible?, NO?, well I don't care, I made a mod that does just that, visually inspired by the cool but underrated 2d Lego™ series: Monkie Kid. The abilities are inspired by the popular chinese legend: Journey To The West.\n\nThis mod adds a way to convert yourself into The Great Sage Equal To Heaven himself and obliterate anyone who stands in your way, packed with an armor set, gear, and a fully fledged second phase, all within this silly mod.\n\n## FEATURES\n- **Building Block**\n> - Mystic Stone (used to make a big rock where Sun Wukong will be born from, to do this, make a 3x3x3 cube with said block and leave a 2 block tall space inside for you to be in, after you do this, a small cutscene will take place [make sure you are standing inside the 2 block tall space before being sealed away in the stone], just wait until it's over to start the fight [It will totally look cool to your friends])\n- **MISC Items**\n> - Fun Value (This debug item, is given by commands and here is what it does: So, as Sun Wukong, you have a custom death animation [no way i'm making you inmortal, that would completely ruin the point of a fight] and other people who are not have a lame death animation, and if you are having a fight like, you against 3 players, before the fight right click the ''boss'' of them 3, so the fight would have a more impressive ending)\n> - Inmortality x2 (Right click to be inmortal, this is experimental)\n> - Pebble (Throw it)\n> - Sleep Insect (Throw this to your oponents to make 'em sleep for a few seconds)\n- **Foodstuff**\n> - Inmortalitly Peach (If these didn't make you inmortal, they'd literally kill you, well, not actually, they won't kill you nor make you inmortal, but will regenerate you extremely fast)\n- **Arsenal**\n> - Phoenix-Feather Crown\n> - Golden Chainmail\n> - Golden Battle Skirt\n> - Cloud-stepping shoes\n> - Full Monkie King Armor Set (Has a lot of abilities)\n> - Ruyi Jingu Bang (Right click to extend it and hit enemies from far away [1 of each 5 will have a giant attack], right click looking down to launch yourself into the air, shift+right click to parry [with a chance of doing a double parry that negates regeneration to the oponent], press Q to throw the staff [it will return])\n> - Advance Gauntlet (There are no gauntlets in the legends, but for the purpose of not adding an inhumane ammount of keybinds, there will be gauntlets, this one allows the user to teleport upon right click, launching all entities in the radious of impact into the air, press Q to power up and do faster and stronger attacks)\n> - Ember Gauntlet (press Q to do Wukong's Flaming Fist Of Fury!, [If you watched Lego Monkie Kid, you will undestand])\n> - Frostmaw Gauntlet (press Q to freeze someone or something in place, once each 5 attacks will perform a special move: Snowgrave)\n- **Abilities**\n> - Ocasionally teleport when hit, negates damage\n> - Can double jump mid-air\n> - Can move fast\n> - Golden Vision of Truth (Can reveal any entity nearby, including players [G])\n> - Cloud Somersault (Can summon a cloud that can go really fast, will despawn in 10 seconds [Spacebar+Shift+Left Click])\n> - Throw stone/mountain (Can throw a block of stone/mountain that will damage enemies nearby [Q with empty hand])\n> - Stone spikes attack (Can impale anyone in a straigh line [shift+Q with empty hand])\n> - Resize (Can make you small and normal size again [Z])\n> - Clones (Can make 20 clones out of you own hair, they are really fast and can ocasionally throw staffs to their targets [C])\n> - Invisibility (Make yourself invisible and invincible for a short period of time, this also causes the clones to stop following you [I])\n\nIf you haven't yet, check out Lego Monkie Kid, is a good show.","2025-01-21T22:28:48.238784Z","2025-01-24T00:13:30.537881Z","2025-01-27T02:41:29.215551Z","2025-01-24T00:14:23.389680Z",{"id":30072,"name":10,"url":3589},453,[115,134,171],[],[354,385],[30317,30318],"PLX107l6","AUdqy4ny","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yQ1IaptL/e2f43e476f1622e24ed0c85505309da9b2dbe3ba.png",[],[30322,30328,30334,30339,30343,30348,30353,30358,30363,30368,30373,30377,30382,30388],{"url":30323,"raw_url":30324,"featured":439,"title":30325,"description":30326,"created":30327,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yQ1IaptL/images/1979bfe4d214640f6f5946fc4e049c5876dae4a6_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yQ1IaptL/images/1979bfe4d214640f6f5946fc4e049c5876dae4a6.png","Wukong's Flaming Fist Of FURY!","You know it if you watched the s