:439,"title":30450,"description":30451,"created":30452,"ordering":30049},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOpBi9OB/images/a224d4c154338bd203ac73bc8dd591ce882201a0_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOpBi9OB/images/a224d4c154338bd203ac73bc8dd591ce882201a0.png","Backpack Recipe","kinda self explanatory","2025-03-25T04:43:56.234428Z",{"url":30454,"raw_url":30455,"featured":439,"title":30456,"description":30457,"created":30458,"ordering":30054},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOpBi9OB/images/62df58448315ce96bc548b0e05e9ead14089d734_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOpBi9OB/images/62df58448315ce96bc548b0e05e9ead14089d734.png","Backpack GUI","so, this is what the backpack gui looks like... it holds a couple items","2025-03-25T04:46:43.958050Z",{"url":30460,"raw_url":30461,"featured":439,"title":30462,"description":30463,"created":30464,"ordering":30158},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOpBi9OB/images/087ddf2af31845a1a615fb0886b1f1af74b1e516_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOpBi9OB/images/087ddf2af31845a1a615fb0886b1f1af74b1e516.png","Backpack Inventory Location","its where backpacks are in the creative inventory ","2025-03-25T04:45:55.239866Z",7289860,"nQs6n7QV",{"client_side":30059,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":30468,"id":30469,"slug":30470,"project_type":31,"team":30471,"organization":3589,"title":30470,"description":30472,"body":30473,"body_url":3589,"published":30474,"updated":30475,"approved":30476,"queued":30477,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":30478,"downloads":30480,"followers":30001,"categories":30481,"additional_categories":30482,"loaders":30483,"versions":30484,"icon_url":30486,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":30487,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":30488,"gallery":30489,"color":30490,"thread_id":30491,"monetization_status":30057},[1046,1040,1007,965,959,887,881],"yPPT2A0T","landclaim-lts","2S6hJ5ZN","Legacy/LTS fork of LandClaimPlugin for Minecraft 1.20.x (Paper/Spigot), Java 21.","Tento projekt poskytuje stabilnú LTS/legacy verziu LandClaimPlugin pre Minecraft 1.20.x, pretože upstream projekt cieli na novšie verzie Minecraftu.\n\nUpstream: https://github.com/synkfr/LandClaimPlugin\nTento fork nie je prepojený s upstream projektom.\nFork spravuje: Likanpp\n\nPodporuje: Paper/Spigot 1.20.x • Vyžaduje: Java 21\nTestované na: Paper 1.20.4 (ostatné 1.20.x sa očakáva že pôjdu, ale nie sú všetky overené)\n\nČo plugin pridáva (funkcie):\n- Ochrana územia pomocou claimovania chunkov (16×16)\n- Trust systém pre hráčov (BUILD / INTERACT / CONTAINER / TELEPORT)\n- Ochrana pred griefingom v claimoch (stavanie, ničenie, používanie kontajnerov)\n- Voliteľné ochrany: PvP / explózie / mob griefing (konfigurovateľné)\n- Admin bypass a nástroje na správu claimov\n- Voliteľná integrácia s WorldGuard (ak je nainštalovaný)\n\nZmeny oproti upstreamu:\n- Backport/kompatibilita pre Minecraft 1.20.x (Paper/Spigot)\n- Zmena `api-version` na 1.20 (aby fungovalo na Paper 1.20.4)\n- Upravené závislosti/build (`pom.xml`) + opravy pre API/materialy mimo 1.20.x\n- Vydávané samostatne ako LTS 1.20.x línia (oddelené od upstream verzií 1.21+)\n\n","2026-01-25T16:10:50.461215Z","2026-01-25T16:39:05.721045Z","2026-02-02T23:03:40.341733Z","2026-01-27T21:19:11.508848Z",{"id":29982,"name":29983,"url":30479},"https://opensource.org/license/mit/",57,[175,303],[],[329,401,417],[30485],"gTkAgRur","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPPT2A0T/9f86b92c15914dbe0b9727e97284ebbda5a702c1_96.webp","https://github.com/likanpp/LandClaimPlugin-LTS-1.20.x?tab=readme-ov-file",[],[],16239913,"8hXdVuow",{"client_side":30059,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":30493,"id":30494,"slug":30495,"project_type":31,"team":30496,"organization":3589,"title":30497,"description":30498,"body":30499,"body_url":3589,"published":30500,"updated":30501,"approved":30502,"queued":30503,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":30504,"downloads":30505,"followers":29985,"categories":30506,"additional_categories":30507,"loaders":30508,"versions":30509,"icon_url":30514,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":30515,"gallery":30519,"color":30601,"thread_id":30602,"monetization_status":30057},[502,496,483],"yPbQWsD8","possums-glow-ink","3ha1mj2Z","Possum's Glow Ink","Significantly reduce Glow-Inked sign lag with custom hexadecimal colors!","# Possum's Glow Ink\n\n## Overview \nA glow-inked sign causes more lag than a sign without it. This is because of the way\nthat the outline of the text is rendered in vanilla game mechanics. \n\nIn areas with lots of glow-inked signs, frames can drop fast for players. This plugin finds a healthy medium - fun, bold colors (configurable by hexadecimal values) without the outline (and without the additional lag).  \n\n## Features\n- Uses the same flow as vanilla Minecraft sign coloring.\n- Normal dyes still apply normal vanilla sign colors.\n- Glow ink sacs turn on custom hex code coloring for the clicked sign side.\n- Clicking a sign with an ink sac removes the glow effect.\n- While custom glow mode is active, dye changes use custom hex colors instead of vanilla dye colors.\n- Avoids vanilla glowing text entirely (The big lag reducer - removes the text outline).\n- Supports normal signs and hanging signs.\n- Operator-only global toggling of the plugin.\n\n## Commands\n\n### /glowink enable\nEnable the plugin.\n\n### /glowink disable\nDisable the plugin.\n\n### /glowink status\nDisplay all applicable plugin information to the user.\n\n### /glowink reload\nReload the config file.\n","2026-06-01T19:52:33.917219Z","2026-06-02T01:13:03.776536Z","2026-06-05T21:52:03.064865Z","2026-06-01T20:18:02.384966Z",{"id":30072,"name":10,"url":3589},15,[100,134,211],[303],[329,350,401,405,417],[30510,30511,30512,30513],"MgAkgkKG","pMtSofm1","yxhxUSXg","5GLe84GO","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPbQWsD8/5eda907359dbd17762f3dba81bf5153c38d1ad15_96.webp",[30516],{"id":3137,"platform":30517,"url":3051