approved":30614,"queued":30615,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":30616,"downloads":30617,"followers":30618,"categories":30619,"additional_categories":30620,"loaders":30621,"versions":30622,"icon_url":30624,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":30625,"gallery":30626,"color":30653,"thread_id":30654,"monetization_status":30057},"optional",[790,787],"yPwKXmrs","trims++","qhVPDGrH","Trims++","New trims, materials and wings trims!","**Trims++** datapack adds:\n### New Trims\n#### - ![[Frost armor trim image]](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e9fd240702ece4a99a2da881496c72b6e20201ef.png) Frost armor trim\n#### - ![[Portal armor trim image]](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/00bb281e71ebe212fdfaec476a66051a3e15bf57.png) Portal armor trim\n#### - ![[Typhoon armor trim image]](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1c3e532ba5c13ea4832b3e67e01c83377c105688.png) Typhoon armor trim\n#### - ![[Ore armor trim image]](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5792339ea42747d1b11dee01b25fd2d0c8a04740.png) Ore armor trim\n\n### New Materials\n#### - ![[Rose Quartz image]](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/32e17a134ac369d94f3831f79c59f3d3c99af79a.png) Rose Quartz (From Create)\n![[Rose quartz material]](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1d1f8d3a26ef947651618bc270ac27922d811b5f.png)\n#### - ![[Echo Shard image]](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/29412c7737a8ce3791eae753b79d911b5f4e543e.png) Echo Shard\n![[Echo material]](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cace11f93b016bc9be4ab30ba363d77dffee4055.jpeg)\n#### - ![[Blaze Rod image]](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/557f8140b98d1f5082be8138ab2bf3d21a6856cd.png) Blaze Rod\n![[Blaze Rod material]](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3e060393826a6719c7896f9295d72cbcf2b0692a.jpeg)\n#### - ![[Breeze Rod image]](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f1f604e98c11b1b956ac5c3d00510afaf76b9307.webp) Breeze Rod\n![[Breeze Rod Material]](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/125226ee48679ba2708cdb823a24799faebde6ed.jpeg)\n\n\nYou can also apply **Armor Trims** on **ELytras** now.\n\n![[elytra trim]](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49e6f598556b6f12f1606bdbf9c96d5ce4dcc193.jpeg)\n(Silence for example)\n\n\nThis datapack is translated to:\n- English (US)\n- Portuguese (Português)\n- Portuguese (Brasilian) (Português Brasileiro)\n- Russian (Русский)\n- Ukrainian (Українська)\n- German (Deutsch)\n\nIf you found bags or bad translation, write me on discord (theslimy)\n\nI hope you will enjoy :)\n\nThx JoeFly for the Portuguese translation, you may like his [datapack](https://modrinth.com/datapack/tool-trims). If you see this, hi Joe!\n\nAlso I borrowed some texures for elytras from Elytra Trims, also go check [them](https://modrinth.com/mod/elytra-trims)","2024-11-14T13:21:33.374147Z","2024-11-14T14:22:59.009142Z","2024-11-16T14:55:14.212587Z","2024-11-14T14:36:37.167751Z",{"id":30072,"name":10,"url":3589},559,8,[30,115,134],[],[342],[30623],"dxbdVJ7m","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPwKXmrs/f767736d3b9297dc60f803c808827c700acda61b_96.webp",[],[30627,30631,30635,30639,30644,30648],{"url":30628,"raw_url":30628,"featured":439,"title":30629,"description":3589,"created":30630,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPwKXmrs/images/2cf722252f94d8c4514c66ad7925440c142b5aa5.jpeg","Typhoon armor trim craft","2024-11-14T13:31:32.653356Z",{"url":30632,"raw_url":30632,"featured":439,"title":30633,"description":3589,"created":30634,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPwKXmrs/images/4db1984d3b56ca66110cdc312b553810b4b645d8.jpeg","Portal armor trim craft","2024-11-14T13:35:07.874153Z",{"url":30636,"raw_url":30636,"featured":439,"title":30637,"description":3589,"created":30638,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPwKXmrs/images/76d6777d2837feff13dbe79c729683c604888cb3.jpeg","Ore armor trim craft","202