is project aims to fill the gap that oppened up when the [Valkyrien Computers](https://modrinth.com/mod/valkyrien-computers) was sunset in favor of the [CC: VS](https://modrinth.com/mod/cc-vs). Unfortunately this new mod no longer offered the capability to control your Valkyrien Skies: Eureka airships using computers. To address this I have added a new peripheral for the Eureka ShipHelm with functions to control the ship.\n\nDocumentation of all of the provided functions can be found [here](https://codeberg.org/fiona06/cc_eureka/wiki/Home).","2026-02-28T19:10:56.114773Z","2026-03-03T01:55:11.703568Z","2026-03-09T03:44:27.078690Z","2026-02-28T19:34:01.280463Z",{"id":29982,"name":29983,"url":3589},729,[288,297],[],[354],[30673,30674,30675],"1xmKNMIa","exXQ9Nre","AhCBgfVO","https://codeberg.org/fiona06/cc_eureka/issues","https://codeberg.org/fiona06/cc_eureka","https://codeberg.org/fiona06/cc_eureka/wiki",[],[],"G4dNRGy0",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":30683,"id":30684,"slug":30685,"project_type":31,"team":30686,"organization":3589,"title":30687,"description":30688,"body":30689,"body_url":3589,"published":30690,"updated":30691,"approved":30692,"queued":30693,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":30694,"downloads":30695,"followers":30039,"categories":30696,"additional_categories":30697,"loaders":30698,"versions":30699,"icon_url":30701,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":30702,"gallery":30703,"color":30710,"thread_id":30711,"monetization_status":30057},[1040],"yOpnR4lY","horndawg","DHDKeNMf","HornDawg","a Simple mod that adds cool Enchants to Goat Horns","## HORN DAWG\n### its a simple little mod that adds 4 enchants to the Goat Horns\n- Avasting  \"while falling use it to have a chicken spawn on you and take you down to safety\"\n- Typhoon   \"spawns are wind disc around you to knock mobs back\"\n- Shriek    \"shoots a warden shriek out of the horn\"\n- Elevation \"shoots people up into the air apon usage\"","2025-05-29T07:49:47.240296Z","2025-05-29T08:08:05.078730Z","2025-06-03T06:20:08.858926Z","2025-05-29T08:17:13.436198Z",{"id":30072,"name":10,"url":3589},245,[30,115,171],[93,191,297],[346,409],[30700],"L9nH39OP","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOpnR4lY/4384be08735ba00533b2a2ae9ca2a5c05c670694_96.webp",[],[30704],{"url":30705,"raw_url":30706,"featured":439,"title":30707,"description":30708,"created":30709,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOpnR4lY/images/4384be08735ba00533b2a2ae9ca2a5c05c670694_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOpnR4lY/images/4384be08735ba00533b2a2ae9ca2a5c05c670694.png","The HornDawg, dog.","woof woof!!","2025-05-29T08:17:05.605818Z",5906193,"NDJiRmR8",{"client_side":30713,"server_side":30713,"game_versions":30714,"id":30715,"slug":30716,"project_type":38,"team":30717,"organization":3589,"title":30718,"description":30719,"body":30720,"body_url":3589,"published":30721,"updated":30722,"approved":30723,"queued":30724,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":30725,"downloads":30001,"followers":29985,"categories":30727,"additional_categories":30728,"loaders":30729,"versions":30730,"icon_url":3589,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":30732,"donation_urls":30733,"gallery":30734,"color":3589,"thread_id":30740,"monetization_status":30741},"unknown",[],"yPtIUCqJ","nitrolandia","TsuYCPcn","NitroLandia","NitroLandia je český semi-vanilla survival server pro hráče, kteří chtějí normální Minecraft bez zbytečných omezení, pay-to-win výhod a přeplácaných pluginů.","**NitroLandia** je český semi-vanilla survival server pro hráče, kteří chtějí normální Minecraft bez zbytečných omezení, pay-to-win výhod a přeplácaných pluginů.\n\nServer běží komunitně, bez VIP systému, bez kupování předmětů a bez Residence. *Nejde* o anonymní survival s lobby, denními odměnami a hromadou příkazů. Cílem je spíš klasický Minecraft zážitek, kde se hráči znají, staví vlastní projekty, spolupracují a nemusí pořád řešit složité ochrany pozemků nebo pluginové systémy.\n\nNitroLandia podporuje Java edici i Bedrock edici, takže se dá hrát i z mobilu přes MCPE, Windows Bedrock, konzole a další zařízení. Server používá jen odlehčené pluginy a datapacky pro základní funkčnost, bezpečnost a drobná vylepšení hry — například mapu světa, podporu Bedrock hráčů, statistiky, logování griefů nebo užitečné quality-of-life datapacky.\n\nPřístup na server je přes registraci nebo pozvánku od hráče. Díky tomu zůstává komunita menší, přehlednější a normálnější než na veřejných survival serverech bez kontroly.\n\n* Český Minecraft survival server\n* Semi-vanilla styl hraní\n* Java + Bedrock / MCPE kompatibilita\n* Bez Residence a složitých ochran pozemků\n* Bez VIP, mikrotransakcí a pay-to-win výhod\n* Komunitní server, kde se hráči znají\n* Odlehčené pluginy, žádné přeplácané systémy\n* Registrace přes web nebo pozvánka od hráče\n\n---\n\n🔗 | Webové stránky: [Navštivte nás zde](https://nitrolandia.xyz/)\n\n👥 | Komunitní Discord: [Připojte se k nám zde](https://discord.gg/3fas5pwu9T)\n\n🌍 | Online Mapa: [Prozkoumejte mapu zde](https://mapa.nitrolandia.xyz)\n\n🎮 | Adresa serveru: nitrolandia.xyz / bedrock.nitrolandia.xyz","2026-05-03T03:58:55.457762Z","2026-05-03T03:58:55.461524Z","2026-05-03T21:39:57.941453Z","2026-05-03T04:01:44.697665Z",{"id":30726,"name":10,"url":3589},"LicenseRef-Unknown",[272,307,311],[90,275,281],[],[30731],"4etkqRYf","https://discord.com/invite/3fas5pwu9T",[],[30735],{"url":30736,"raw_url":30737,"featured":439,"title":30738,"description":3589,"created":30739,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPtIUCqJ/images/1c122e20e64aa455a4f6b0ad61cb162791aeb2f3_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPtIUCqJ/images/1c122e20e64aa455a4f6b0ad61cb162791aeb2f3.png","__mc_server_banner__","2026-05-03T03:59:06.368778Z","HByYTFVi","force-demonetized",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":30059,"game_versions":30743,"id":30744,"slug":30745,"project_type":12,"team":30746,"organization":3589,"title":30747,"description":30748,"body":30749,"body_url":3589,"published":30750,"updated":30751,"approved":30752,"queued":30753,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":30754,"downloads":30755,"followers":29985,"categories":30756,"additional_categories":30757,"loaders":30758,"versions":30759,"icon_url":30761,"issues_url":30762,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":30763,"gallery":30764,"color":30777,"thread_id":30778,"monetization_status":30057},[1007,998,995,992,989,986,983,965,959,950,947,944,941,938,935,932,929,926,923,920,917,914,911,908,905,902,887,881,878,875,872,869,844,838,835,832,829,826,823,820,817,814,811,808,790,787,784,781,778,757,709,667,658,652,607,601,556],"yPqbudE5","whimscape-yyzsbackpack-add-on","yrPUUReV","Whimscape yyzsbackpack add-on","add-on resource pack for whimscape to add gui for yyzsbackpack","An add-on for [Whimscape resource pack](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/whimscape) to add GUI for [yyz's backpack mod](https://modrinth.com/mod/yyzs-backpack) to have a complete look.\n\n**I'm not associated with either of the original authors, don't ask them for help if something doesn't work with this speific resource pack, chances are they won't be able to help**\n\nFor resource pack to work simply copy zip archive to resourcepacks folder in game directory and enable it from the in-game options","2026-03-12T16:00:00.409813Z","2026-03-12T16:12:02.613813Z","2026-03-14T06:48:18.910944Z","2026-03-12T16:30:08.131990Z",{"id":30072,"name":10,"url":3589},155,[139,194,292],[15,300],[377],[30760],"EgNhYN1y","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPqbudE5/c7cb78feafebea0713dcb4e21b898fbeda9ed6dd.png","https://codeberg.org/CoolGirlAyden/Aydens_resourcepacks/issues",[],[30765,30769,30773],{"url":30766,"raw_url":30766,"featured":846,"title":30767,"description":3589,"created":30768,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPqbudE5/images/e850f0bcc17c1b6eb159010b4201984682558e6e.png","Iron backpack","2026-03-12T16:22:27.860560Z",{"url":30770,"raw_url":30770,"featured":439,"title":30771,"description":3589,"created":30772,"ordering":29985},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPqbudE5/images/b68d1c1f2942441c5ff1f505dd35bc0568ca4f6d.png","Gold backpack","2026-03-12T16:22:49.555144Z",{"url":30774,"raw_url":30774,"featured":439,"title":30775,"description":3589,"created":30776,"ordering":30034},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPqbudE5/images/4cd8641950eaff6ca345789e80192dfb10e9fe09.png","Diamond/netherite backpack","2026-03-12T16:23:24.326048Z",1469481,"aFJndP59",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":30780,"id":30781,"slug":30782,"project_type":31,"team":30783,"organization":3589,"title":30784,"description":30785,"body":30786,"body_url":3589,"published":30787,"updated":30788,"approved":30789,"queued":30790,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":30791,"downloads":30792,"followers":30793,"categories":30794,"additional_categories":30795,"loaders":30796,"versions":30797,"icon_url":30819,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":30820,"gallery":30821,"color":30842,"thread_id":30843,"monetization_status":30057},[881,844,838,787,757,709,667,658,652,607,601,556,483],"yPjno2zz","colorful-books","312aQUER","Colorful Books","Decorate, organize & display your books with colour! Works with Lecterns, Chiseled Bookshelves & Enchanting Tables!","# 📚 Colorful Books\n![4 Books: Book dyed yellow, Written Book dyed lime, Book and Quill dyed cyan & Enchanted book dyed red](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/146e8395515862456c1da48ac258718072f54ab2.png)\n\n#\n# 🎨 Dyeing & Undyeing\nDye as vanilla does it! Combine dyes with a **Book, Book and Quill, Written Book or Enchanted Book** in crafting grid to give it a splash of color. Wash off your dye by using a dyed book on a **Cauldron** with water in it. Don't worry, the ink of your written pages won't come off!\n![2 GUIs: Inventory, where a Book and Quill is combined with Purple Dye to dye it & Crafting Table, where an already dyed Book is combined with White, Blue & Yellow dye to give it a unique tint. Outside of the GUIs: Ari is looking down at her hands, Steve is looking at a Crafting Table & Sunny is washing the dye of a book in a Water Cauldron](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPjno2zz/images/e7df6e4b0d0c352f334402cea5e83fa2454d1843.png)\n\n#\n# ✒️ Lectern, Writing & Librarian\nWrite with color! **Book and Quills & Written Books** which are dyed will display their dye on a **Lectern** or in their respective GUIs for everyone to see. **Librarians** will still accept dyed books for their **Trades**, and even keep the dye!\n![2 GUIs: Book and Quill, on the sign page, showing the black cover of the book & Villager Trading, where the select trade is converting a book into an enchanted book. Outside of the GUIs: Efe signing a black Book and Quill, a Librarian looking confused at her & a Lectern displaying a Red Book](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPjno2zz/images/ad1158955795124efafe0dbe0af408814625188f.png)\n\n#\n# ✨ Enchanting Table & Chiseled Bookshelves\nDisplay with pride! When crafting an **Enchanting Table** with a dyed book, the Enchanting Table will display a dyed book in the world and in the GUI. **Chiseled Bookshelves** will also display the color of their books, allowing you to organize and decorate!\n![2 GUIs: Enchanting Table GUI, with an Iron Sword & 5 Lapis, the book is green & Crafting Table  where an Enchanting Table is crafted with a pink dyed book. Outside of GUIs: Makena is standing by Chiseled Bookshelves with differently coloured books in it, she is looking at a Green dyed book ontop of the Enchanting Table. Alex is standing behind the chiseled bookshelves, looking at a Crafting Table](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPjno2zz/images/38670e17de257ffb234e7009ee47b7b1a2ca5848.png)\n\n#\n# 🏦 Enchanted Books & Loot\nEnchant with mysteriouly colorful books! **Enchanted Books** found as **Loot** will be dyed based on their **Enchantments**. If a book has multiple enchantments, it will blend them!  \n![1 GUI: Chest with loot, and a tooltip showing an Enchanted Book that is \"Dyed\". Outside of GUIs: Kai jumps as a Vault shoots out an Enchanted Book dyed white & Ari looks into a chest](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPjno2zz/images/20464301e87cdd80a988a1bad1ea92a14c4ae1d8.png)\n\n#","2024-10-27T10:22:40.549032Z","2026-04-28T19:58:42.517148Z","2024-10-30T01:34:24.094339Z","2024-10-27T13:09:02.277562Z",{"id":30072,"name":10,"url":3589},23113,142,[30,100,115],[171,279,316],[346],[30798,30799,30800,30801,30802,30803,30804,30805,30806,30807,30808,30809,30810,30811,30812,30813,30814,30815,30816,30817,30818],"eaE0RGCz","nosbYy86","IcC0XpbI","xiOVePlV","LYeSBjSA","BQeQPPMO","Ju9baw46","laQGVsGF","1hckCCdR","f2khMGQk","pVRUSipV","4PNFXvwm","fytQ5hcE","syqIck4x","40MqyHAF","xXTn7Ma3","BAjEoKbf","OPHzzHEU","G9tjQdKn","xxU2Rl4V","qaApv7ax","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPjno2zz/97aaba4aebe81f6b44b8c8aebe196dd38910354c_96.webp",[],[30822,30827,30832,30837],{"url":30823,"raw_url":30824,"featured":439,"title":30825,"description":3589,"created":30826,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPjno2zz/images/20464301e87cdd80a988a1bad1ea92a14c4ae1d8_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPjno2zz/images/20464301e87cdd80a988a1bad1ea92a14c4ae1d8.png","Enchanted Books & Loot","2024-10-27T10:36:15.538489Z",{"url":30828,"raw_url":30829,"featured":439,"title":30830,"description":3589,"created":30831,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPjno2zz/images/38670e17de257ffb234e7009ee47b7b1a2ca5848_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPjno2zz/images/38670e17de257ffb234e7009ee47b7b1a2ca5848.png","Enchanting Table & Chiseled Bookshelves","2024-10-27T11:23:53.876282Z",{"url":30833,"raw_url":30834,"featured":846,"title":30835,"description":3589,"created":30836,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPjno2zz/images/ad1158955795124efafe0dbe0af408814625188f_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPjno2zz/images/ad1158955795124efafe0dbe0af408814625188f.png","Writing, Trading & Lectern","2024-10-27T10:35:55.072750Z",{"url":30838,"raw_url":30839,"featured":439,"title":30840,"description":3589,"created":30841,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPjno2zz/images/e7df6e4b0d0c352f334402cea5e83fa2454d1843_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPjno2zz/images/e7df6e4b0d0c352f334402cea5e83fa2454d1843.png","Dyeing & Undyeing","2024-10-27T11:23:33.524400Z",9342606,"lSCm1C7H",{"client_side":30059,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":30845,"id":30846,"slug":30847,"project_type":31,"team":30848,"organization":3589,"title":30849,"description":30850,"body":30851,"body_url":3589,"published":30852,"updated":30853,"approved":30854,"queued":30855,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":30856,"downloads":30857,"followers":29985,"categories":30858,"additional_categories":30859,"loaders":30860,"versions":30861,"icon_url":30863,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":30864,"gallery":30865,"color":30866,"thread_id":30867,"monetization_status":30057},[844,838,790,787,757,709,667,658,652,607,601,556],"yPrNhUTM","guardian-anti-cheat","QzwtJdxH","Guardian Anti-Cheat","This project adds a new amazing anti-Cheat to prevent those pesky hackers!","Guardian Anti-Cheat – Powerful Protection for Paper 1.21.x\n\nGuardian Anti-Cheat is a modern, high-performance anti-cheat plugin built specifically for Paper 1.21.x servers. Designed for accuracy, speed, and reliability, Guardian protects your server from unfair advantages while keeping gameplay smooth for legitimate players.\n\nUsing advanced movement analysis, packet validation, and behavioral detection systems, Guardian Anti-Cheat can identify a wide range of cheats in real time. The system continuously analyzes player actions to detect exploits such as fly hacks, speed hacks, reach, kill aura, autoclickers, scaffold, and other combat or movement modifications.\n\nGuardian is built with a modular architecture, allowing server owners to easily configure and fine-tune detection checks to match their server’s gameplay style. Each check includes adjustable thresholds, detailed logging, and optional verbose alerts to help staff monitor suspicious behavior without overwhelming the console.\n\nKey Features\n\n🛡 Advanced Cheat Detection – Detects combat, movement, and packet-based cheats\n⚡ Optimized for Paper 1.21.x – Lightweight and designed for high-performance servers\n🔧 Highly Configurable – Customize checks, thresholds, and punishments\n📡 Real-Time Staff Alerts – Instantly notify moderators when suspicious activity occurs\n📊 Detailed Logging & Debug Tools – Track violations with clear and informative logs\n🔌 Modular Check System – Enable, disable, or adjust individual detections\n👨‍💻 Developer-Friendly API – Extend Guardian with custom checks or integrations\n\nGuardian Anti-Cheat focuses on accuracy and stability, minimizing false positives while providing strong protection against modern cheat clients. Whether you run a competitive PvP network or a casual survival server, Guardian keeps your server fair, secure, and cheat-free.","2026-03-17T00:17:24.313742Z","2026-03-17T00:18:37.866891Z","2026-03-17T02:26:28.043722Z","2026-03-17T00:25:05.953504Z",{"id":30072,"name":10,"url":3589},151,[175,211,303],[],[401],[30862],"5qZghDgc","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPrNhUTM/5ea87b6088cf07dacafd8d896a4cb85803d61726_96.webp",[],[],666200,"CyXmA8JB",{"client_side":30604,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":30869,"id":30870,"slug":30871,"project_type":31,"team":30872,"organization":3589,"title":30873,"description":30874,"body":30875,"body_url":3589,"published":30876,"updated":30877,"approved":30878,"queued":30879,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":30880,"downloads":30881,"followers":30034,"categories":30882,"additional_categories":30883,"loaders":30884,"versions":30885,"icon_url":30887,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":30888,"donation_urls":30889,"gallery":30890,"color":30901,"thread_id":30902,"monetization_status":30057},[757],"yPEBzE1V","glow-it-up","qAgXgqLN","Glow it up","Recipes for light blocks in crafting table and stonecutter","Adds several useful recipes for the invisible light block. Also allows to change the light level of already existing ones.","2025-01-28T12:03:02.564958Z","2025-01-28T12:03:57.759789Z","2025-02-01T19:52:27.612536Z","2025-01-28T12:12:12.377957Z",{"id":30072,"name":10,"url":3589},66,[134],[303],[342],[30886],"K2Nee2nH","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPEBzE1V/c71b98ae4270565d6411f73de8ca64debf614b2c_96.webp","https://discord.com/invite/6nnyCYaz4H",[],[30891,30896],{"url":30892,"raw_url":30892,"featured":439,"title":30893,"description":30894,"created":30895,"ordering":29985},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPEBzE1V/images/47a183aafd6f695597f46e961f8e93b7103b97ad.png","Stonecutter recipies.","Allows for changing the light blocks light level.","2025-01-28T12:09:22.542480Z",{"url":30897,"raw_url":30897,"featured":439,"title":30898,"description":30899,"created":30900,"ordering":29985},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPEBzE1V/images/a51292289c377763d4f09440612f69bbb9953c4a.png","Crafting recipe.","Allows for using different light sources, including very strange ones...","2025-01-28T12:08:50.406194Z",7170147,"jmusxjJA",{"client_side":30059,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":30904,"id":30905,"slug":30906,"project_type":31,"team":30907,"organization":3589,"title":30908,"description":30909,"body":30910,"body_url":3589,"published":30911,"updated":30912,"approved":30913,"queued":30914,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":30915,"downloads":30916,"followers":29985,"categories":30917,"additional_categories":30918,"loaders":30919,"versions":30920,"icon_url":30922,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":30923,"donation_urls":30924,"gallery":30925,"color":30931,"thread_id":30932,"monetization_status":30057},[844,838,790,787,757,709],"yPN488PG","pingviewer","1Q43Nt3V","Ping Viewer","A simple plugin that allows you to see your ping with a command","# **Ping Viewer**\n\n**A simple and lightweight plugin that allows players to instantly check their current latency (ping) to the server with a single command.**\n\n---\n\n## **⭐ Core Features**\n\n*   **Instant Ping Display:** Provides an immediate and accurate reading of a player's ping in milliseconds.\n*   **Zero Configuration:** No setup required.\n*   **Extremely Lightweight:** Designed to be highly efficient with no impact on server performance.\n*   **User-Friendly:** Clean and simple output makes it easy for any player to check their connection status.\n\n---\n\n## **⌨️ Commands & Permissions**\n\nThe main command is **/ping**.\n\n*   **/ping**\n    *   Displays your current ping to the server.\n    *   **Default:** Granted to all players.\n\n---\n\n## **💡 Suggestions & Feedback**\n\n**Want to request changes or need support? Join my Discord and share your ideas!**\n\n🔗 https://discord.gg/kGfcXWG7mx","2025-06-01T14:23:39.900951Z","2025-06-01T15:01:31.562115Z","2025-06-09T07:57:43.852423Z","2025-06-01T15:09:31.112516Z",{"id":30072,"name":10,"url":3589},507,[134,288,303],[],[329,401,405,417],[30921],"uB4OvO4b","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPN488PG/97db99e3ca46b52608493b952795f4ac834e9c7a_96.webp","https://discord.gg/kGfcXWG7mx",[],[30926],{"url":30927,"raw_url":30928,"featured":439,"title":30929,"description":3589,"created":30930,"ordering":29985},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPN488PG/images/4f28c39f32228ce903802a2a2a0c3998c7080385_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPN488PG/images/4f28c39f32228ce903802a2a2a0c3998c7080385.png","Logo","2025-06-01T15:06:58.871185Z",3553849,"ktCnpSSC",{"client_side":30604,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":30934,"id":30935,"slug":30936,"project_type":31,"team":30937,"organization":3589,"title":30938,"description":30939,"body":30940,"body_url":3589,"published":30941,"updated":30942,"approved":30943,"queued":30944,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":30945,"downloads":30948,"followers":30001,"categories":30949,"additional_categories":30950,"loaders":30951,"versions":30952,"icon_url":30955,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":30956,"gallery":30957,"color":30978,"thread_id":30979,"monetization_status":30057},[601,556],"yQ6C2mYt","structure-pvp","5NvISqX1","Structure PVP","Terrain-based super-assembly PVP game","Terrain-based super-assembly PVP game \\\n### How to play\nThe first time to use the data, please follow the tips:\n1. Create a void world and add the datapack to your world\n2. Create the lobby by the steps after using\n```\nfunction structurepvp:init\n```\n3. Call your friends with you to play the game\n4. Press the `Join as a Player` to join the game\n5. Press the `Start Game`\n6. You will have 60 seconds to choice a place to spawn after the map generated\n7. Fight! The last surviving player will be the winner\n### Tips\n1. You can modify the equipments in creative mode after you created the lobby (Keep the facing direction of the shulker boxes unchanged, otherwise you may be not able to open it when the game started)\n2. All players will be glowed permanently without invisibility effect\n3. The location of lobby will determine the terrains\n\n### Thanks for playing","2026-02-13T17:02:00.531666Z","2026-02-13T17:33:31.777576Z","2026-02-17T07:58:59.973509Z","2026-02-13T17:34:11.246937Z",{"id":30946,"name":30947,"url":3589},"LGPL-3.0-or-later","GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 or later",158,[115,185],[],[342,346,354,385,409],[30953,30954],"16V3wloY","zUM7DIwJ","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yQ6C2mYt/7cd491c6c537a855a90bc1d93c3ce77753e84437_96.webp",[],[30958,30963,30968,30973],{"url":30959,"raw_url":30960,"featured":846,"title":30961,"description":3589,"created":30962,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yQ6C2mYt/images/4bebf9af96d4f1ae9d022be72a742ef14f47a34d_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yQ6C2mYt/images/4bebf9af96d4f1ae9d022be72a742ef14f47a34d.png","Lobby","2026-02-13T17:14:52.807726Z",{"url":30964,"raw_url":30965,"featured":439,"title":30966,"description":3589,"created":30967,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yQ6C2mYt/images/8aede79419fb5cb19382f37c7cbb3145c7b3c5b9_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yQ6C2mYt/images/8aede79419fb5cb19382f37c7cbb3145c7b3c5b9.png","Win","2026-02-13T17:16:06.276580Z",{"url":30969,"raw_url":30970,"featured":439,"title":30971,"description":3589,"created":30972,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yQ6C2mYt/images/e10cc27c7caad54e02344eaa6c6b79e07d3de232_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yQ6C2mYt/images/e10cc27c7caad54e02344eaa6c6b79e07d3de232.png","Game play","2026-02-13T17:15:09.491361Z",{"url":30974,"raw_url":30975,"featured":439,"title":30976,"description":3589,"created":30977,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yQ6C2mYt/images/e519bdb144a7d323d44fea906a5e02f0e1f911be_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yQ6C2mYt/images/e519bdb144a7d323d44fea906a5e02f0e1f911be.png","Combat","2026-02-13T17:15:53.855991Z",9599333,"4x9F5Pln",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":30981,"id":30982,"slug":30983,"project_type":31,"team":30984,"organization":3589,"title":30985,"description":30986,"body":30987,"body_url":3589,"published":30988,"updated":30989,"approved":30990,"queued":30991,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":30992,"downloads":30993,"followers":30994,"categories":30995,"additional_categories":30996,"loaders":30997,"versions":30998,"icon_url":31003,"issues_url":31004,"source_url":31005,"wiki_url":31005,"discord_url":31006,"donation_urls":31007,"gallery":31008,"color":31009,"thread_id":30982,"monetization_status":30057},[1538,1535,1505,1499,1487,1466,1310,1295,1268,1211,1178,1169,1046,1040],"yOmOmAiF","spoorn-bounty-mobs","eRS2Gt2w","Spoorn Bounty Mobs","Mobs have a chance to spawn marked with a Bounty and gain special abilities/stats/rewards.  Player Bounty Hunters also gain stats based on progress","![spoornbountymobs](https://i.imgur.com/vadvELV.gif)\n----------------------------------------------------\n\n![colors](https://i.imgur.com/MVdDInI.gif)\n\n[![https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=%20&message=other%20projects&color=4b5966&labelColor=658f79&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge](https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=%20&message=other%20projects&color=4b5966&labelColor=658f79&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge)](https://modrinth.com/user/spoorn \"https://modrinth.com/user/spoorn\") [![https://img.shields.io/discord/990178919795785749?color=4b5966&label=%20&labelColor=658f79&logo=discord&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge](https://img.shields.io/discord/990178919795785749?color=4b5966&label=%20&labelColor=658f79&logo=discord&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge)](https://discord.gg/xfddZwG898 \"https://discord.gg/xfddZwG898\") [![https://img.shields.io/github/stars/spoorn/SpoornBountyMobs?color=4b5966&labelColor=658f79&label=github%20&logo=github&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge](https://img.shields.io/github/stars/spoorn/SpoornBountyMobs?color=4b5966&labelColor=658f79&label=github%20&logo=github&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge)](https://github.com/spoorn/SpoornBountyMobs \"https://github.com/spoorn/SpoornBountyMobs\") [![https://img.shields.io/github/issues-raw/spoorn/SpoornBountyMobs?color=4b5966&labelColor=658f79&label=issues%20&logo=github&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge](https://img.shields.io/github/issues-raw/spoorn/SpoornBountyMobs?color=4b5966&labelColor=658f79&label=issues%20&logo=github&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge)](https://github.com/spoorn/SpoornBountyMobs/issues \"https://github.com/spoorn/SpoornBountyMobs/issues\")\n\nMobs have a chance to spawn marked with a Bounty!   A marked Bounty mob will have special effects, sizes, stats, and will bountifully reward the player with **fully configurable loot drops**, and bonus stats upon bounty hunter level ups, enhancing the combat experience.\n\nThe vision for this mod is to upgrade the experience when fighting mobs and give incentive for exploring to find these special Bounty mobs and hunt them down.  This can enhance existing mob hunting systems, or players can grind to become a full fledged Bounty Hunter.  A full list of Bounty mob stats, Player Bounty Hunter stats, and rewards are listed below. \n\nThe mod is fully configurable.  If you want a more vanilla feel, meaning you just want random mobs to possibly spawn with enhanced stats without the glowing or changed sizes, you can set the following:\n\n*   \"bountyMobGlowDuration\": 0\n*   \"showBountyParticleEffects\": false\n*   and set for all tiers: \"mobSizeScale\": 1\n\nSee below for how to edit the configuration file\n\nBounty Mobs\n-----------\n\n*   6 Tiers: Common, Uncommon, Rare, Epic, Legendary, Doom\n*   Bonus stats based on tiers: Bonus Health, damage, experience drop \n    *   Different size scaling\n    *   Each tier has a configurable highlight color\n    *   Weakness Effect\n    *   Wither Effect\n    *   Blindness\n    *   Poison\n    *   Slowness\n    *   Hunger\n    *   Fire Attacks\n    *   Resistance\n    *   Regeneration\n    *   More coming...\n\nPlayer Stats\n------------\n\n*   Kill Counts for each Tier of Bounty mobs killed\n*   Bounty Hunter score based on the kill counts\n*   Bounty Hunter Level based on the score and configuration\n*   Bonus Health based on the highest Bounty Hunter Tier reached\n*   Bonus Damage based on the highest Bounty Hunter Tier reached\n*   More coming...\n\nLoot Drops\n----------\n\nLoot drops are configured for every tier.  The mod comes with default preconfigured drops, but you can remove them or change them (check the Configuration sections below for more details).\n\nEach tier has a list of drops mapped to entity identifiers (or regex patterns of entity identifiers).  Each drop in the list has that entity identifier pattern, a drop chance, number of rolls, and list of weighted items that can drop.  You can think of each Drop as like a Loot Table.\n\nWhen a player kills a Bounty Mob, all matching Drops roll through their list of weighted items (higher weights more likely to drop), and drops items based on the configuration.\n\nConfiguration\n-------------\n\nThe configuration file is fully documented here: [https://github.com/spoorn/SpoornBountyMobs/blob/main/config-documentation.json5](https://github.com/spoorn/SpoornBountyMobs/blob/main/config-documentation.json5)\n\n(Documentation in the config file is also generated when you load the mod)\n\nThe config file is at `config/spoornbountymobs.json5`. There are configurations for each Tier of mobs, and top-level configurations such as chance for mob to be marked with a bounty, Bonus health/damage per Player's Bounty Hunter Level, etc.\n\nFor example, if you want to turn off the highlights to have a more immersive and chance encounter experience, you can set `\"bountyMobGlowDuration\" : 0.`\n\n### Loot Drop Configuration\n\nLoot drops are finally here! \n\n**The mod comes with default preconfigured loot drops.  If you had previously installed this mod, you'll need to delete the config file and restart the game to regenerate it.**\n\nThis is **FULLY CONFIGURABLE** end to end.  You can configure for each tier, what distribution of item drops can drop for any mob entity.  The configuration supports regex meaning you can fully customize the loot drops for any items (including other mods) and any mob entity (including other mods).  See the config documentation for schema and example: [https://github.com/spoorn/SpoornBountyMobs/blob/main/config-documentation.json5#L38-L142](https://github.com/spoorn/SpoornBountyMobs/blob/main/config-documentation.json5#L38-L142)\n\nCommands\n--------\n\n`/spoornbountymobs stats \u003Cplayer>` Will display the player's stats\n\nI want to eventually add a UI for this\n\n![commands](https://i.imgur.com/Za9pwlF.gif)\n\nRequirements\n------------\n\n![requires fabric](https://i.imgur.com/HabVZJR.png)\n\nAlso requires Cloth Config API: [https://modrinth.com/mod/cloth-config](https://modrinth.com/mod/cloth-config)\n\nRecommended to include HealthOverlay so you can see how many Hearts you have beyond the vanilla cap: [https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/health-overlay-fabric](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/health-overlay-fabric) \n\nThis mod is required on both client and server\n\nNeed a Server?\n--------------\n\n[![https://bisecthosting.com/spoorn](https://i.imgur.com/KPURPK0.png)](https://bisecthosting.com/spoorn \"https://bisecthosting.com/spoorn\")","2023-07-18T18:09:05.080696Z","2023-07-18T18:12:07.365896Z","2023-07-21T00:54:34.844660Z","2023-07-18T18:13:33.743875Z",{"id":29982,"name":29983,"url":3589},4351,18,[30,185,191],[],[346],[30999,31000,31001,31002],"qk26hM7A","i4yLEuIA","TWMe6kS4","wNr6pwTA","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOmOmAiF/42445e37d6c30e84ef4e64517c02a4ab115ee0da_96.webp","https://github.com/spoorn/SpoornBountyMobs/issues","https://github.com/spoorn/SpoornBountyMobs","https://discord.gg/xfddZwG898",[],[],14517573,{"client_side":29969,"server_side":30059,"game_versions":31011,"id":31012,"slug":31013,"project_type":12,"team":31014,"organization":3589,"title":31015,"description":31016,"body":31017,"body_url":3589,"published":31018,"updated":31019,"approved":31020,"queued":31021,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":31022,"downloads":31025,"followers":30001,"categories":31026,"additional_categories":31027,"loaders":31028,"versions":31029,"icon_url":31031,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":31032,"gallery":31033,"color":31037,"thread_id":31038,"monetization_status":30057},[844,838],"yPdwTh9C","no-wind-sound","HNHwU9SS","No Wind Sound","This resource pack removes the wind charge sound from the game","**The Wind Charge sound can be very distracting, especially during intense PvP or while completing parkour maps.**\n\n\nThis resource pack completely mutes the Wind Charge explosion sound. This allows you to focus on your movement, aim, and gameplay mechanics and removes the annoying noise\n\n\n## Features:\n- Removes Wind Charge explosion sound.\n- Client-side only (works on multiplayer servers).\n- You're not getting annoyed\n\n![No Wind Sound](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/894d5647dd7eaebb075f562eff566dcd23762146.png)","2025-11-22T15:07:50.177214Z","2025-11-22T15:18:30.305639Z","2025-11-24T09:03:57.594074Z","2025-11-24T02:14:47.016538Z",{"id":31023,"name":31024,"url":3589},"CC-BY-4.0","Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International",92,[50,303,307],[15,77,100,300],[377],[31030],"MMwjMSqI","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPdwTh9C/894d5647dd7eaebb075f562eff566dcd23762146.png",[],[31034],{"url":31035,"raw_url":31035,"featured":846,"title":31015,"description":3589,"created":31036,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPdwTh9C/images/894d5647dd7eaebb075f562eff566dcd23762146.png","2025-11-22T15:19:11.715646Z",12303821,"UH9hgaeO",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":30059,"game_versions":31040,"id":31041,"slug":31042,"project_type":12,"team":31043,"organization":3589,"title":31044,"description":31045,"body":31046,"body_url":3589,"published":31047,"updated":31048,"approved":31049,"queued":31050,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":31051,"downloads":31052,"followers":30039,"categories":31053,"additional_categories":31054,"loaders":31055,"versions":31056,"icon_url":31059,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":31060,"donation_urls":31061,"gallery":31062,"color":31103,"thread_id":31104,"monetization_status":30057},[2531,2513,2489,2486,2480,2477,2474,2471,2468,2333,2282,2270,2267,2243,2240,2222,2219,2216,2168,2162,2159,2102,2093,2084,1925,1901,1892,1775,1766,1751,1736,1712,1643,1637,1628,1538,1535,1505,1499,1487,1466,1391,1373,1310,1295,1268,1211,1178,1169,1133,1094,1046,1040,1007,965,959,887,881,844,838,790,787,757,709,667,658,652,607,601,556,502,496,483],"yOcvc16d","atomic-vanilla","FF5RAQbG","Atomic Delight Vanilla","Celebrate 1,000 subscribers with ArZaN-MC’s professional Vanilla+ texture pack. Featuring Fresh Animations support, animated textures, and shader compatibility, it delivers a high-performance, visually enhanced experience optimized for survival and PvP.","Minecraft as it was meant to be seen. The Atomic Vanilla Texture Pack is a comprehensive \"Vanilla Plus\" overhaul designed for players who refuse to compromise between high-performance FPS and breathtaking visuals. Originally released to celebrate the 1k subscriber milestone, this pack brings a professional-grade polish to your survival and PvP worlds.\n\n## Key Features:\n\n- Optimal Performance: Lightweight textures and baked-in optimizations to ensure smooth frame rates during intense PvP and Hunger Games matches.\n- Dynamic Animation: Full support for Fresh Animations, bringing mobs to life with fluid, natural movements.\n- Animated Textures: Custom-coded animated items and blocks provide a living, breathing environment.\n- Shader Ready: Built-in compatibility for modern shaders, enhancing light transmission and surface reflections.\n- Visual Enhancements: Subtle \"Vanilla+\" tweaks that sharpen the game’s aesthetic without losing its iconic charm.\n\n![The Visual Representation of Pack being used in a Screenshot](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e953dba466f3948618abbde6fb7e46b78fe033bf.png)\n\n**Other Texture Packs Used by ArZaN-MC**\n- [Bushy Leaves Texture Pack](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/leaves-plus)\n- [Glowing Ores Texture Pack](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/new-glowing-ores)\n- [Frest Animations Texture Pack](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/fresh-animations)\n\n**Visual Mod Packs Used by ArZaN-MC**\n- [Hold My Items Mod Pack](https://modrinth.com/mod/hold-my-items)\n- [Falling Leaves Mod Pack](https://modrinth.com/mod/fallingleaves)\n\n**Join our Discord for full list of ModPacks used by ArZaN-MC**\n- https://discord.gg/EF6tPUDWJv\n\n**If You Havent Subscribed ArZaN-MC Still**\n- https://youtube.com/@ArZaN-MC","2024-09-19T05:54:10.633968Z","2026-05-25T09:27:38.676039Z","2024-10-04T18:27:45.364386Z","2024-10-02T12:52:23.856687Z",{"id":30072,"name":10,"url":3589},6223,[15,77,139],[115,128,268,300,307],[377],[31057,31058],"52D34oEc","LUsn2t2S","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOcvc16d/7f6b38220270b43ccb31eb9a9d9d9016048f1cff.png","https://discord.gg/Yx4xXWrEGx",[],[31063,31069,31075,31081,31087,31093,31098],{"url":31064,"raw_url":31065,"featured":439,"title":31066,"description":31067,"created":31068,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOcvc16d/images/e953dba466f3948618abbde6fb7e46b78fe033bf_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOcvc16d/images/e953dba466f3948618abbde6fb7e46b78fe033bf.png","A Warrior’s Repose","Under a canopy of falling cherry blossoms and gentle rain, an armored warrior sits in quiet reflection. This scene highlights the pack's atmospheric weather effects and beautiful floral textures, perfect for moments of peace between battles.","2026-03-16T15:54:10.152240Z",{"url":31070,"raw_url":31071,"featured":439,"title":31072,"description":31073,"created":31074,"ordering":29985},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOcvc16d/images/1f24949ccaab07665b4259c34caaa63b93a515a3_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOcvc16d/images/1f24949ccaab07665b4259c34caaa63b93a515a3.png","Atomic Horizons","Golden sunlight washes over a surreal landscape of floating islands and mystical clouds. This breathtaking view highlights the pack's exceptional color grading and lighting, proving that even a simple