eg","The Castle of ArZaN","Majestic spires and fortified walls rise above a bustling medieval courtyard. This wide-angle shot showcases the pack's enhanced lighting and crisp textures, bringing grand architectural builds to life with cinematic scale.","2026-03-16T15:52:48.107257Z",{"url":31099,"raw_url":31099,"featured":846,"title":31100,"description":31101,"created":31102,"ordering":30049},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOcvc16d/images/f4e970b9a88896290b1e94c5acec647bcb5f815e.jpeg","Pack Banner","Why would banner need a description ?","2026-03-16T16:46:58.401358Z",16177088,"YUhQrWtS",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":30059,"game_versions":31106,"id":31107,"slug":31108,"project_type":31,"team":31109,"organization":3589,"title":31110,"description":31111,"body":31112,"body_url":3589,"published":31113,"updated":31114,"approved":31115,"queued":31116,"status":29957,"requested_status":29960,"moderator_message":3589,"license":31117,"downloads":31118,"followers":30158,"categories":31119,"additional_categories":31120,"loaders":31121,"versions":31122,"icon_url":31138,"issues_url":31139,"source_url":31140,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":31141,"gallery":31142,"color":31148,"thread_id":31149,"monetization_status":30057},[844,838,790,787,757,709,667,658,652,607,601,556,502,496,483],"yOnoFrVo","greedy-meshing-mod","DLzia36X","Greedy Meshing Mod","Optimizes chunk rendering by merging identical adjacent block faces into larger quads, reducing the total number of quads the GPU needs to render.","# Greedy Meshing Mod\n\nA client-side Fabric optimization mod that merges identical adjacent block faces into larger quads, reducing the total vertex count for better GPU performance.\n\n## Features\n- Automatic merging of opaque full-cube block faces\n- Custom terrain shaders for correct texture tiling on merged faces\n- [Sodium](https://modrinth.com/mod/sodium) compatible\n- Debug wireframe and split-screen comparison mode\n- In-game config screen (requires [Cloth Config](https://modrinth.com/mod/cloth-config) + [Mod Menu](https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu))\n\n## Supported Versions\n\n| Minecraft | Loader |\n|-----------|--------|\n| 1.21 - 1.21.11 | Fabric |\n| 26.1 - 26.1.2 | Fabric |\n\n## Performance\nPerformance gains vary depending on your hardware and world. If your GPU is already underutilized (high FPS), the improvement may be minimal. The mod might benefits most on lower-end GPUs, higher render distances, and worlds with large flat surfaces of the same block type (e.g. superflat, underground caves, large builds).\n\n## Known Limitations\n- **Experimental** — some mods that modify chunk rendering or terrain shaders may be incompatible. Disable via config if issues occur.\n- **Shader packs** (Iris/OptiFine) are not fully supported — the mod falls back to face-culling-only mode.\n- **Lighting** on large merged surfaces may look slightly different from vanilla.\n\n## Credits\nFork of [Greedy Meshing](https://modrinth.com/mod/greedy-meshing) by BuggiestStudios, with significant modifications including multi-version support (via [Stonecutter](https://github.com/stonecutter-versioning/stonecutter)), binary meshing.","2026-04-17T02:16:18.163763Z","2026-04-17T02:57:56.990179Z","2026-05-28T21:47:08.926547Z","2026-05-25T00:03:01.260Z",{"id":29982,"name":29983,"url":3589},383,[211],[],[346],[31123,31124,31125,31126,31127,31128,31129,31130,31131,31132,31133,31134,31135,31136,31137],"Y9gSUyYR","yI5ElOby","GliuXKsJ","5gE2O7ng","ef7c7Z3X","Gz5h1P0F","iHdqUNx1","xNwxA8qC","dVxaxpsH","A1TJbxnf","vi6vJ9Q9","NyC97H4I","DbZ3O5aC","oQNLu60h","JMTlrIH8","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOnoFrVo/8bb1d07a08b2cfa8e6984784c2c2e199a9ce01b4_96.webp","https://github.com/programmer1o1/GreedyMeshingMod/issues","https://github.com/programmer1o1/GreedyMeshingMod",[],[31143],{"url":31144,"raw_url":31145,"featured":846,"title":31146,"description":3589,"created":31147,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOnoFrVo/images/7ed05a50e9c4d875153db47fe325