ted":31326,"ordering":31327},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPbBrzEX/images/b24debe0059a9231618ef48666365afb6756e52b_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPbBrzEX/images/f74e7f243502e23ec6f8805d38a4c6a5a06df292.png","Old Pridepack Banner","A few biis pollinating a flower with glow berries on the background","2023-12-03T01:58:34.365972Z",999,{"url":31329,"raw_url":31330,"featured":439,"title":31331,"description":31332,"created":31333,"ordering":31334},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPbBrzEX/images/82cac054d1a0dddd5b514fb161992cefdb373c19_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPbBrzEX/images/82cac054d1a0dddd5b514fb161992cefdb373c19.png","The Best Place to Download PridePack.","9Minecraft better","2023-04-01T12:35:36.188626Z",99999999,791572,{"client_side":29969,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":31337,"id":31338,"slug":31339,"project_type":31,"team":31340,"organization":3589,"title":31341,"description":31342,"body":31343,"body_url":3589,"published":31344,"updated":31345,"approved":31346,"queued":31347,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":31348,"downloads":31351,"followers":30049,"categories":31352,"additional_categories":31353,"loaders":31354,"versions":31355,"icon_url":31372,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":31373,"gallery":31374,"color":31379,"thread_id":31380,"monetization_status":30057},[1268,1169,1040,959,844,838],"yQDmTpwv","croparium-mekanism","oubboTnK","Croparium: Mekanism","Turn Mekanism minerals into farmable crops—harvest them the agricultural way!","![Title](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cabbf0896a490a79be23922183406cfa88d2d0d0.png)\n\nDependencies: [**Croparium**](https://modrinth.com/mod/croparium) and [**Mekanism**](https://modrinth.com/mod/mekanism)\n\nThis mod adds farming functionality for 10 types of minerals and materials from Mekanism, allowing players to obtain these resources through agricultural means.\n\nDifferent crops have specific planting conditions: most crops need to be planted on Overworld Farmland, while the two crops—Mekanism Refined Glowstone Crop and Mekanism Refined Obsidian Crop—require Tough Ore Farmland.\n\n**How to Reclaim Farmland**\n\n_Overworld Farmland_\n\nHold any pickaxe in your main hand and right-click common Overworld stones (e.g., regular Stone, Deepslate, and Cobblestone variants) to convert them into usable farmland. This farmland needs a water source within a 4-block horizontal radius.\n\n_Tough Farmland_\n\nHold a Diamond Pickaxe or Netherite Pickaxe in your main hand and right-click Obsidian, Crying Obsidian, or Deadrock (a series of stones from the Twilight Forest mod) to convert them. This farmland requires a lava source within a 4-block horizontal radius to support crop growth.\n\nFor details on how to obtain seeds, as well as specific information about crop planting and growth processes, please refer to [**Croparium**](https://modrinth.com/mod/croparium) mod for more instructions.\n\n![Title](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c8af2570b06d480266a12355be354c6d58de0c08.png)","2025-10-24T12:42:46.652015Z","2026-04-20T19:21:19.204167Z","2025-10-29T03:30:07.837214Z","2025-10-24T12:52:14.233492Z",{"id":31349,"name":31350,"url":3589},"CC-BY-NC-4.0","Creative Commons Attribution Non Commercial 4.0 International",1005,[134,288,303],[],[354,385],[31356,31357,31358,31359,31360,31361,31362,31363,31364,31365,31366,31367,31368,31369,31370,31371],"E5HTsIQA","nsWV5ZNY","P0oUNIHT","KV8iqyc1","NyijPmCa","p2Se1AV1","sSjK4OKa","8y4qmzpD","oAlznPXP","yGj3IGqU","JFi5iQIJ","Rv8TqDpn","ZEAgBS5g","zeFO0mGa","apI9RQNC","2xX8elWl","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yQDmTpwv/9306f037f2d0817e48736f08b1ade246485c7a9c.png",[],[31375],{"url":31376,"raw_url":31376,"featured":439,"title":31377,"description":3589,"created":31378,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yQDmTpwv/images/cabbf0896a490a79be23922183406cfa88d2d0d0.png","Ores that are growable","2025-10-24T12:51:32.407012Z",1118994,"TijT7XIv",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":31382,"id":31383,"slug":31384,"project_type":31,"team":31385,"organization":3589,"title":31386,"description":31387,"body":31388,"body_url":3589,"published":31389,"updated":31390,"approved":31389,"queued":3589,"status":29957,"requested_status":3589,"moderator_message":3589,"license":31391,"downloads":31392,"followers":29985,"categories":31393,"additional_categories":31394,"loaders":31395,"versions":31396,"icon_url":31399,"issues_url":31400,"source_url":31401,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":31402,"gallery":31403,"color":31404,"thread_id":31383,"monetization_status":30057},[2633,1487],"yOeZiwcI","spaghettibolognese","FAt3p6dT","Spaghetti Bolognese","A restoration of the legendary CR43Z33M0NK3Y's mods.","This is a rewrite of the original code for the Spaghetti Bolognese mod created by [CR43Z33M0NK3Y](https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/cr43z33m0nk3y/). Due to it being inactive since 2011, and due to several of my friends wanting the mod added to our server, I have gone to the effort of rewriting all the code to be compatible with 1.16.4. This will eventually expand to include a rewrite of all of their original mods.\n\nTo see which current mods are added to the remake, please check the source code readme.","2021-01-25T19:53:25.849502Z","2021-01-25T19:57:07.343108Z",{"id":30407,"name":30408,"url":3589},309,[100,131],[],[346,354],[31397,31398],"2XgnWT6e","1X42J28P","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOeZiwcI/icon.png","https://github.com/DrTinyFace/spaghettibolognese-1.16.4/issues","https://github.com/DrTinyFace/spaghettibolognese-1.16.4",[],[],1905668,{"client_side":29969,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":31406,"id":31407,"slug":31408,"project_type":31,"team":31409,"organization":3589,"title":31410,"description":31411,"body":31412,"body_url":3589,"published":31413,"updated":31414,"approved":31415,"queued":31416,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":31417,"downloads":31420,"followers":31421,"categories":31422,"additional_categories":31423,"loaders":31424,"versions":31425,"icon_url":31459,"issues_url":31460,"source_url":31461,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":31462,"donation_urls":31463,"gallery":31469,"color":31482,"thread_id":31483,"monetization_status":30057},[1040,838,787,757,709,667,658,652,601,556],"yP77bAiA","piggyback","GTpTjeYY","Piggyback","Allow player riding each other and replace the default player sitting mechanic with a piggyback-style ride. Carry your friends on your back for fun, teamwork, or pure chaos!","\u003Cp align=\"center\">\n    \u003Cimg src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Piggyback/piggyback_title.png?raw=true\" alt=\"banner\"/>\n\u003C/p>\n\n\u003Cdiv align=\"center\">\n    \u003Ca href=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/\" target=\"_blank\">\n        \u003Cimg alt=\"github\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_vector.svg\">\n    \u003C/a>\n    \u003Ca href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/faewulf/projects\" target=\"_blank\">\n        \u003Cimg alt=\"curseforge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\">\n    \u003C/a>\n    \u003Ca href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/FaeWulf\" target=\"_blank\">\n        \u003Cimg alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"> \n    \u003C/a>\n    \u003Ca href=\"https://faewulf.xyz/discord/\" target=\"_blank\">\n        \u003Cimg alt=\"discord-singular\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\">\n    \u003C/a>\n\u003C/div>\n\n\n\u003Cdiv align=\"center\">\n    \u003Ca href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faewulf\" target=\"_blank\">\n        \u003Cimg alt=\"kofi-singular\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\">\n    \u003C/a>\n    \u003Ca href=\"https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/faewulf\" target=\"_blank\">\n        \u003Cimg alt=\"paypal-singular\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/paypal-singular_vector.svg\">\n    \u003C/a>\n\u003C/div>\n\n---\n\n## 📑 Overview\n\n**Piggybacks** is a fun and small mod that changes Minecraft's default sitting mechanic into a more natural piggyback-style ride. Instead of sitting on another player’s head, you now ride on their back, perfect for co-op adventures, silly roleplays, or chaotic situations!.\n\n## 📦 Features\n\n- Right-click a crouching player with an empty hand to hop on their back.\n- Replaces the sitting position with a piggyback posture.\n- Fully compatible with multiplayer.\n- Supports player stacking (yes, you can build a human totem!).\n- The rider can't turn around to look behind, similar to when riding a boat.\n- Optional setting to slow down the carrier while they're carrying someone.\n\n## 🎥 Showcases\n\n- How to ride:\n\u003Cimg src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Piggyback/howToUse.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"hot to use showcase\"/>\n- Player tower\n\u003Cimg src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Piggyback/example2.png?raw=true\" alt=\"example 1\"/>\n\u003Cimg src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Piggyback/example1.png?raw=true\" alt=\"example 2\"/>\n\n## ⚙️ Configs\n\nThe mod can be config via:\n- Config file locates in config/piggyback.toml\n- In-game config menu\n\n## ⚠️ Required mods\n\n- Fabric API\n- Faewulfs Lib\n\n## 🔗 Compatibility\n\nPiggybacks is designed to be compatible with other mods. If you encounter any issues, please report them on the\nmod's issues tracker.\n\n## 💖 Support\n\nFor support, feature requests, or bug reports, please visit the mod's GitHub issues page.\nor join my Discord server: [link](https://faewulf.xyz/discord)\n\n## 📜 License\n\nYou can use this mod in modpack as long as giving proper credits.","2025-04-13T05:26:02.872688Z","2026-01-24T15:12:28.922368Z","2025-04-23T21:47:30.411148Z","2025-04-19T08:35:37.844121Z",{"id":31418,"name":31419,"url":3589},"CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0","Creative Commons Attribution Non Commercial Share Alike 4.0 International",97336,174,[93,134,275],[297,303],[346,354,385,409],[31426,31427,31428,31429,31430,31431,31432,31433,31434,31435,31436,31437,31438,31439,31440,31441,31442,31443,31444,31445,31446,31447,31448,31449,31450,31451,31452,31453,31454,31455,31456,31457,31458],"1znQ971A","v6fEaLH8","7N75VgTX","2rngI4ty","UYrxIX7A","cc2tf6oZ","1RIujuFh","5BXDzcJ7","I5Dnxatv","82f41OeO","8l0UuP9x","Qo53oMNP","oenNbJZG","j2iIK5GH","QaPMJHPM","uT1rsyQa","iJIfxtIN","3PT8Yw7v","qFWAYAUt","hY2jOr2y","bEsZeeqZ","j3jAeNOd","SsOn1lVI","zBNKQZnP","NMWCi03C","h4HGf24z","JJkY1ZtI","B37Im2H5","Bgbn9bGO","91IaLhug","sBwFFoXJ","h6R82NHS","MugsgtOg","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP77bAiA/27c8ddcf2d4e384ebf5498196b5fbd3cab0159ef_96.webp","https://github.com/FaeWulf/piggyback/issues","https://github.com/FaeWulf/piggyback","https://faewulf.xyz/discord",[31464,31467],{"id":3140,"platform":31465,"url":31466},"Paypal","https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/faewulf",{"id":3146,"platform":3147,"url":31468},"https://ko-fi.com/faewulf",[31470,31474,31478],{"url":31471,"raw_url":31472,"featured":439,"title":3589,"description":3589,"created":31473,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP77bAiA/images/51eeba2c3b813ceb400c3a55208fb2a1a263567a_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP77bAiA/images/51eeba2c3b813ceb400c3a55208fb2a1a263567a.png","2025-04-13T05:29:07.312061Z",{"url":31475,"raw_url":31476,"featured":439,"title":3589,"description":3589,"created":31477,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP77bAiA/images/59da1beff192e959d6e66178aac58a00a37236ff_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP77bAiA/images/59da1beff192e959d6e66178aac58a00a37236ff.png","2025-04-13T05:29:24.774399Z",{"url":31479,"raw_url":31480,"featured":439,"title":3589,"description":3589,"created":31481,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP77bAiA/images/8c641c45d0db53f63682fff5dd807d2a40f81577_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP77bAiA/images/8c641c45d0db53f63682fff5dd807d2a40f81577.png","2025-04-13T05:29:15.785077Z",12091756,"L8bt7NuB",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":30059,"game_versions":31485,"id":31486,"slug":31487,"project_type":12,"team":31488,"organization":3589,"title":31489,"description":31490,"body":31491,"body_url":3589,"published":31492,"updated":31493,"approved":31494,"queued":31495,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":31496,"downloads":31497,"followers":30001,"categories":31498,"additional_categories":31499,"loaders":31500,"versions":31501,"icon_url":31504,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":31505,"gallery":31506,"color":31513,"thread_id":31514,"monetization_status":30057},[556],"yOp5NUqZ","sword-to-stick","t6DheWA7","Sword To Sticks","Changes all the sword textures to sticks (except the copper one)","A random texture pack that changes all the sword textures to a stick for some reason (except the copper sword for some reason). \n\n \n\n### **Made for version 1.21.11**\n\nTried making it work for the trident, but the model didn't change, only the item did :(\n\ni love fighting with sticks\n![Combat tab](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6770ddafb8c69e1778c567bdf00dcd887d5286ee_0.webp)","2026-02-28T22:31:22.570298Z","2026-06-11T01:22:33.213026Z","2026-03-10T01:57:39.507331Z","2026-02-28T22:46:51.093307Z",{"id":29982,"name":29983,"url":3589},82,[77,93,148],[15,115],[377],[31502,31503],"nIfEsovy","JxSWoGhf","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOp5NUqZ/ff53d2b804dab0485fd6b48bb4dea18dc8eb7323.png",[],[31507],{"url":31508,"raw_url":31509,"featured":846,"title":31510,"description":31511,"created":31512,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOp5NUqZ/images/6770ddafb8c69e1778c567bdf00dcd887d5286ee_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOp5NUqZ/images/6770ddafb8c69e1778c567bdf00dcd887d5286ee.png","Combat tab with s t i c k s","even the combat tab logo is a stick","2026-02-28T22:45:22.271205Z",4008208,"sAOfukkt",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":31516,"id":31517,"slug":31518,"project_type":31,"team":31519,"organization":3589,"title":31520,"description":31521,"body":31522,"body_url":3589,"published":31523,"updated":31524,"approved":31525,"queued":31526,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":31527,"downloads":31528,"followers":31529,"categories":31530,"additional_categories":31531,"loaders":31532,"versions":31533,"icon_url":31555,"issues_url":31556,"source_url":31557,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":31558,"gallery":31561,"color":31595,"thread_id":31596,"monetization_status":30057},[1046,1040,838],"yP3WOSCW","industrialdeco","kDPNLp5q","IndustrialDeco (Street Lamps)","Industrial decorations (and street lamps!)","Have you ever been infuriated with the lack of mods adding modern-ish industrial decorations to modern Minecraft versions? Fear not! This mod fixes that!\n\nContents:\n\n- Street lamps - Because lanterns are boooring\n- Office-style light fixtures - Now you can experience the horror of a 9-5 office job IN MINECRAFT!\n- Security cameras - Literally 1984\n- Distribution boxes - Now you can trip the breaker without your whole faminly yelling at you!\n- Small wire boxes - A place for you to stuff all of your \"expert-level\" wiring\n- Wires - to make the \"expert-level\" wiring\n- Wall switches - Come on, who doesn't love a big rotary switch?\n- Cage lamps - Now you call your apartment \"loft\" and sell it for 2x as much!\n- Warning poles - They only speak Polish tho\n- Chimneys - Because no other mod adds these!1!11!\n- EUR-Pallet - Dimensionally accurate!\n- Benches - With anti-homeless railings already installed!\n- Metal fences - Because wood isn't hard _enough_\n- Crossbucks - So people can't claim liability after being hit by your train\n\n  \nBlocks can now be rotated, or their type changed, by right-clicking with a _**properly tagged**_ wrench, or a stick (I am NOT adding a wrench, too many mods already have those). Some blocks can also be picked up with the Create mods' wrench.\n\n![An image with all the mod contents (in version 0.0.1) visible](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5740e2b5260a4f50d09ceb2450028c7e0955ec31.png)\n![Blocks added in 0.7.0](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP3WOSCW/images/6a92b2b1a3eb46de42a8ab76ba7fba2ad0b17a90.png)\n![New office light fixtures and wire boxes added in 0.4](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP3WOSCW/images/4cc547cb1a64b43ca3289dd6f34f95a04acde2c5.png)\n![Benches added in 0.0.5](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP3WOSCW/images/2bc771e0cc6f933ac56903f9fc0357211fc14289.png)\n![Stuff added in 1.0.0](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP3WOSCW/images/856431d5017a97119f6fa3a74c75b4afc9ae1ade.png)\n\nIdeas for more stuff I should add are more than welcome on the GitHub issue tracker","2024-11-22T14:36:44.954239Z","2026-04-02T15:27:42.903066Z","2024-11-24T04:10:31.118006Z","2024-11-22T14:53:57.619373Z",{"id":31418,"name":31419,"url":3589},4762,9,[100],[],[354,385],[31534,31535,31536,31537,31538,31539,31540,31541,31542,31543,31544,31545,31546,31547,31548,31549,31550,31551,31552,31553,31554],"ag9ejWgI","Qix0YEJH","g3QX13yS","LMLTkTFb","VRqsBb5T","ER9zSgMN","pLcqrWRp","faqg9CGI","Tx2DVNht","aNq5zUrJ","Zu0j7JMw","Q0TocpP4","jujwY1o2","R2CHsH71","G7ZLhFQo","p1opq3gb","9eOFHpLB","QHgaoM2q","sI8LPez9","UeLS35yV","Ttm575OB","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP3WOSCW/3d968747881e58ffbbb970d516ae3de14934a511_96.webp","https://github.com/DrogaMleczna/IndustrialDeco/issues","https://github.com/DrogaMleczna/IndustrialDeco",[31559],{"id":3146,"platform":3147,"url":31560},"https://ko-fi.com/