ies","![Title](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2fb8db3e236308d17b58e7e814a010967af40356_0.webp)This Texture Pack revisits the main PvP Items with a sharp and dark look and enhances some features to enjoy PvP freely and with less distractions.\n### Textures\n- Animated Totem\n- Black&White Glint\n- Main PvP Weapons (Sword, Axe, Bow, Crossbow)\n- Other PvP Weapons (Mace, Spear, Trident, TNT Minecart, End Crystal etc.)\n- Other PvP Items (Gaps, Ender Pearls, Wind Charges etc.)\n- Different Textures for The Mace (Light Breach / Dark Density)\n- Custom Hotbar Icons (Hearts, Hunger, Armor)\n- Darker Hotbar, Item Selector and EXP Bar\n- Dark GUI\n- Small Caps Font\n### Main Features\n- Small Held Items\n- Smaller Totem Pop\n- Less Intrusive Shield and Smaller Sword (Dagger Style)\n- Low Fire (On Player and On Ground)\n- Invisible Pumpkin and Fishing Hook\n- Custom PvP Crosshair\n- No Particles (Explosion, Potions, Damage, Food)\n- More Visible Powedered Snow\n- Fullbright*\n- Less Intrusive Weather\n- More Visible Cobwebs (Light Blue)\n\n> *May not work if you have Sodium activated","2026-03-19T19:27:09.257279Z","2026-03-21T19:55:30.524410Z","2026-03-22T02:15:36.732953Z","2026-03-21T20:29:56.468458Z",{"id":30072,"name":10,"url":3589},395,[77,139,148],[15,115],[377],[31799],"vKiq5GH0","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOeZJ16U/5d9b5cc234a5013597757deb712219e903908c91_96.webp",[],[31803,31807,31812,31817,31823,31828],{"url":31804,"raw_url":31804,"featured":439,"title":31805,"description":3589,"created":31806,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOeZJ16U/images/bf22a40f916f9ab2bc75579ae93ec7f655168a32.png","Main Items","2026-03-21T20:10:27.555968Z",{"url":31808,"raw_url":31809,"featured":439,"title":31810,"description":3589,"created":31811,"ordering":29985},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOeZJ16U/images/b3d770eabad3acecb18bd01a3fb7c1b55677078b_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOeZJ16U/images/b3d770eabad3acecb18bd01a3fb7c1b55677078b.png","3D Items (EC, Cobweb, Armor, TNT)","2026-03-21T19:56:22.585322Z",{"url":31813,"raw_url":31814,"featured":439,"title":31815,"description":3589,"created":31816,"ordering":30034},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOeZJ16U/images/e5a2d9beca8d467a6a9b2513e6bfe0d2654b01e1_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOeZJ16U/images/e5a2d9beca8d467a6a9b2513e6bfe0d2654b01e1.png","Trident and Arrow","2026-03-21T20:09:12.581344Z",{"url":31818,"raw_url":31819,"featured":439,"title":31820,"description":31821,"created":31822,"ordering":30039},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOeZJ16U/images/120edad688aabef1dfaadcf2c1e4cb3d565f8b12_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOeZJ16U/images/120edad688aabef1dfaadcf2c1e4cb3d565f8b12.png","Hotbar and Crosshair ","The Armor Slot on bottom left is not part of the pack, it is a mod called Uku's Armor Hud by Uku. You can download that here:\nhttps://modrinth.com/mod/ukus-armor-hud","2026-03-21T19:59:14.424022Z",{"url":31824,"raw_url":31825,"featured":846,"title":31826,"description":3589,"created":31827,"ordering":30044},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOeZJ16U/images/ea117ab123a98cfce94e5ae11191696b65c5cdaf_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOeZJ16U/images/ea117ab123a98cfce94e5ae11191696b65c5cdaf.png","Thumbnail","2026-03-21T20:23:55.774348Z",{"url":31829,"raw_url":31830,"featured":439,"title":31831,"description":3589,"created":31832,"ordering":30049},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOeZJ16U/images/1f28141f6489f457843d2269e11b3115859c8ae4_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOeZJ16U/images/1f28141f6489f457843d2269e11b3115859c8ae4.png","In-Game Pack Icon","2026-03-21T20:10:47.275599Z",6249563,"3hblX4M9",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":31836,"id":31837,"slug":31838,"project_type":31,"team":31839,"organization":3589,"title":31840,"description":31841,"body":31842,"body_url":3589,"published":31843,"updated":31844,"approved":31845,"queued":31846,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":31847,"downloads":31497,"followers":30001,"categories":31848,"additional_categories":31849,"loaders":31850,"versions":31851,"icon_url":31853,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":31854,"gallery":31855,"color":31856,"thread_id":31857,"monetization_status":30057},[556],"yPNfmiuK","morefruit","arbGSl3D","More Fruit","This project adds more fruit to minecraft!","This mod adds several new fruits to Minecraft: bananas, oranges, and pears. These fruits can be crafted using simple farming ingredients like wheat and sugar, giving players more food options early in the game. Each fruit restores hunger and provides a slightly different food value, offering variety while fitting naturally into Minecraft’s farming progression. Any suggestions would be great!","2026-03-14T19:07:41.510013Z","2026-03-14T19:11:51.742715Z","2026-03-29T00:55:00.397515Z","2026-03-14T19:14:26.664564Z",{"id":30072,"name":10,"url":3589},[30,131],[],[346],[31852],"RIOUnngU","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPNfmiuK/9112ca1aae904904990236c0a7007bc67121fceb.png",[],[],10828830,"fuK63bPb",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":30059,"game_versions":31859,"id":31860,"slug":31861,"project_type":12,"team":31862,"organization":3589,"title":31863,"description":31864,"body":31865,"body_url":3589,"published":31866,"updated":31867,"approved":31868,"queued":31869,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":31870,"downloads":31871,"followers":29985,"categories":31872,"additional_categories":31873,"loaders":31874,"versions":31875,"icon_url":31877,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":31878,"gallery":31879,"color":31885,"thread_id":31886,"monetization_status":30057},[1046,1040,1007,965,959,887,881,844,838,790,787,757,709,667,658,652,607,601],"yP74CcR1","jungle-panorama","8fQp8ICx","Jungle panorama","replaces the standard main menu panorama with a night jungle","replaces the standard main menu panorama with a beautiful night jungle\n\n\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>the details\u003C/summary>\n\nthe panorama shows the night jungle and a bamboo forest on the shore, where you can see many mobs  (ComplementaryUnbound r5.6.1 was used to create this panorama)\n\n\u003C/details>\n\n","2025-11-09T09:21:09.494385Z","2025-11-09T09:24:09.357982Z","2025-11-10T06:28:41.944306Z","2025-11-09T09:50:14.051298Z",{"id":30072,"name":10,"url":3589},97,[],[],[377],[31876],"3ZyA5ZoG","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP74CcR1/ba8e4e9b7153d9463ffd5bd9713dcffa73687b59_96.webp",[],[31880],{"url":31881,"raw_url":31882,"featured":439,"title":31883,"description":3589,"created":31884,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP74CcR1/images/f6c264b1aeb7f0158b8b9ad7e1a854338b40c7fd_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP74CcR1/images/f6c264b1aeb7f0158b8b9ad7e1a854338b40c7fd.png","main menu panorama","2025-11-09T09:24:52.570950Z",1844014,"fsRXaD4g",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":30059,"game_versions":31888,"id":31889,"slug":31890,"project_type":31,"team":31891,"organization":3589,"title":31892,"description":31893,"body":31894,"body_url":3589,"published":31895,"updated":31896,"approved":31897,"queued":31898,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":31899,"downloads":31900,"followers":30001,"categories":31901,"additional_categories":31902,"loaders":31903,"versions":31904,"icon_url":31910,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":31911,"gallery":31912,"color":31925,"thread_id":31926,"monetization_status":30057},[652],"yQFOyqao","java-expanded","cUzLiguW","Java Expanded","This mod adds new advancements, structures, and more to come!","Ever thought Vanilla Minecraft was too plain? Well, this should kind of help with that.\nJava Expanded adds a handful of nice things to the game while definitely keeping the Vanilla feel.\n(This is only a prototype, so it's not the best version.)\n\n   Additions include:\n- A new structure\n- A small handful of advancements\n- 1 Painting\n\nYeah, that's pretty much it lol.\n\n(Also, there are older versions of the mod listed on CurseForge. So, if there's any confusion surrounding versions, there are 3 older versions available.)\n\nCurseForge Link:https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/java-expanded\n\nYouTube Showcase \u003Ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/hx31yCQUUJo\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen>\u003C/iframe>","2026-04-28T22:37:45.592709Z","2026-05-03T19:40:06.133966Z","2026-05-03T01:24:42.662573Z","2026-04-28T22:51:08.012674Z",{"id":29982,"name":29983,"url":3589},25,[],[],[385],[31905,31906,31907,31908,31909],"QKVELyWc","N4wGvYrY","JQRieRaf","tnGlgakM","CYwEOPUt","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yQFOyqao/7f3fc11888e7a1e1223652eddb44ba415933a610_96.webp",[],[31913,31919],{"url":31914,"raw_url":31915,"featured":439,"title":31916,"description":31917,"created":31918,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yQFOyqao/images/673d018e4672bed5c0f2b8e97d5dee345855e39d_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yQFOyqao/images/673d018e4672bed5c0f2b8e97d5dee345855e39d.png","Abandoned Outpost Fixed (Kinda)","I (mostly) fixed the abandoned outpost.","2026-05-03T18:32:21.217463Z",{"url":31920,"raw_url":31921,"featured":439,"title":31922,"description":31923,"created":31924,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yQFOyqao/images/e47d8255148a65dcd020cece6eea0780abb8734c_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yQFOyqao/images/e47d8255148a65dcd020cece6eea0780abb8734c.png","Abandoned Outpost","The first attempt I had at generating structures.","2026-04-29T20:49:25.268372Z",16777215,"O1GS3TQy",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":31928,"id":31929,"slug":31930,"project_type":31,"team":31931,"organization":3589,"title":31932,"description":31933,"body":31934,"body_url":3589,"published":31935,"updated":31936,"approved":31937,"queued":31938,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":31939,"downloads":31940,"followers":30044,"categories":31941,"additional_categories":31942,"loaders":31943,"versions":31944,"icon_url":31954,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":31955,"gallery":31956,"color":31987,"thread_id":31988,"monetization_status":30057},[838],"yP9gqg5C","dimensions-dungeons","inCzF5LP","Dimensions & Dungeons","Explore a new world full of undiscovered possibilities, with new dimensions, bosses, mobs and structures.","Explore a new world full of undiscovered possibilities, with new dimensions, bosses, mobs and structures. This mod is waiting for you to start an incredible journey!\n\nPlease be aware that this mod is in alpha so expect bugs and unfinished features. We will keep updating the mod with time so stay tuned for updates.\n\n**This mod requires Geckolib to function properly.**\n\n\n\n# **FINISHED FEATURES:**\n\n**Eternal Forest Dimension:**\n\n- **New Biomes:** Eternal Forest and Small Forest Biome, Eternal Dark Forest and Small Dark Forest Biome, the Eternal Desert Biome, Amethyst Grottoes, Amazonian Hollows, Caverns of Hell and more...\n- **New Mobs:** Magic Fairy, Woodsper Monster, Friendly Goblin, Crystal Golem and new bosses.\n- **New important items:** New keys for dimensional travel, a dimensional reverser to go back to the overworld and a huge variety of new minerals and their respective armor and tools.\n- **New structures:**  A bigger and harder dungeon, Goblin huts, a mysterious massive tree and new desert pyramids.\n- **New flowers:** Purple allium, light blue orchid, pink cactus flower and pink lily of the valley.\n- **New food:** Purple Berry, Eternal apple and glowsapple.\n# **UPCOMING FEATURES:**\n\n**One new dimensions:** The Hot Plains.\n\n**New useful items.**\n\n**New foods.**\n\n**New building blocks.**\n\n**New mobs.**\n\n**New structures.**\n\n**New biomes.**\n\n# **GUIDE**\n\nFirst, you have to find the new hard dungeon underground and loot the chests to get 4 **Eternal Forest key fragments**.\n\nThese fragments are essential for crafting the **key** for the Eternal Forest dimension.\n\n**CRAFTING RECIPE:**\n\n![Eternal Forest Key Recipe](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/995072b1ad310164d09cdd9a5fe3d9102c123a3c.png)\n\nThis key isnt useful by itself, to make it properly usable you need to craft the **Dimensional Traveller**.\n\n**CRAFTING RECIPE:**\n\n![Dimensional Traveller Recipe](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cafb2c09745707f26a0104c044e3df51e71c77a5.png)\n\nWith the key, you have to right click on the **Dimensional Traveller** to activate the portal to the **Eternal Forest dimension**. To travel to the dimension, you need a **ender eye** on your main hand and right click on the activated Dimension Traveller.\n\nTo go back to the overworld, you need to craft the **Dimensional Reverser**.\n\n**CRAFTING RECIPE:**\n\n![Dimensional Reverser Recipe](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8cb9c517c5dd560e4d14c6e8731564ea8b1505db.png)\n\nTo use it,  you just have to right click, and you will go back to the overworld.","2025-08-28T16:51:49.758007Z","2026-02-15T18:15:11.811783Z","2025-09-06T05:36:16.040898Z","2025-08-28T17:08:33.742278Z",{"id":30072,"name":10,"url":3589},625,[30,171,191],[100,115,131],[385],[31945,31946,31947,31948,31949,31950,31951,31952,31953],"VcUpZhnE","Snx6YgaN","sVBXzVV0","rG68hvch","TOHMMoOv","680w1PP1","fWJwzEDT","bYRGXjUT","Lc6KLN77","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP9gqg5C/7078003926bede82672c32778676a91a3fcf7353_96.webp",[],[31957,31962,31967,31972,31977,31982],{"url":31958,"raw_url":31959,"featured":439,"title":31960,"description":3589,"created":31961,"ordering":29985},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP9gqg5C/images/89421058b13293474a0930fe3183e12b994420b5_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP9gqg5C/images/89421058b13293474a0930fe3183e12b994420b5.png","Camping","2025-09-22T11:54:38.329649Z",{"url":31963,"raw_url":31964,"featured":439,"title":31965,"description":3589,"created":31966,"ordering":30034},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP9gqg5C/images/dd9d33c614ce7657e475918e3aae0648501e3711_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP9gqg5C/images/dd9d33c614ce7657e475918e3aae0648501e3711.png","Purple Berry Bush","2025-09-22T11:55:04.092493Z",{"url":31968,"raw_url":31969,"featured":439,"title":31970,"description":3589,"created":31971,"ordering":30039},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP9gqg5C/images/c1dcd08342725786b020ad15cf1d320e5f71dcf0_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP9gqg5C/images/c1dcd08342725786b020ad15cf1d320e5f71dcf0.png","From the Heights","2025-09-22T11:55:24.811750Z",{"url":31973,"raw_url":31974,"featured":439,"title":31975,"description":3589,"created":31976,"ordering":30044},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP9gqg5C/images/b7edcd270f7ba90217da0aba5faf6a65517b48ce_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP9gqg5C/images/b7edcd270f7ba90217da0aba5faf6a65517b48ce.png","Eternal Pyramid","2025-09-22T11:56:11.684690Z",{"url":31978,"raw_url":31979,"featured":439,"title":31980,"description":3589,"created":31981,"ordering":30049},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP9gqg5C/images/5792c58148a07193c9e62765f914037770b2ba94_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP9gqg5C/images/5792c58148a07193c9e62765f914037770b2ba94.png","Ancient Dungeon","2025-09-22T11:55:48.993203Z",{"url":31983,"raw_url":31984,"featured":846,"title":31985,"description":3589,"created":31986,"ordering":30054},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP9gqg5C/images/2271fa822f0c2f5d3e2c6fee127a43f02364337c_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yP9gqg5C/images/2271fa822f0c2f5d3e2c6fee127a43f02364337c.png","Arachnid Cavern","2025-09-22T11:56:53.010814Z",13653358,"IOucKRKk",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":31990,"id":31991,"slug":31992,"project_type":31,"team":31993,"organization":3589,"title":31994,"description":31995,"body":31996,"body_url":3589,"published":31997,"updated":31998,"approved":31999,"queued":32000,"status":29957,"requested_status":29959,"moderator_message":3589,"license":32001,"downloads":32004,"followers":32005,"categories":32006,"additional_categories":32007,"loaders":32008,"versions":32009,"icon_url":32023,"issues_url":32024,"source_url":32025,"wiki_url":32026,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":32027,"gallery":32028,"color":32039,"thread_id":32040,"monetization_status":30057},[1046,1040,1007,965,959,887,881,844,838],"yPlaLxD1","iron-furnaces","hgfqVssw","Iron Furnaces","Inspired by cpw's Iron Chests mod, adds a few different tiers of furnace.","Maximize smelting efficiency with unparalleled speed, reconfigurable sides, augments for smoking and blasting, and much more.\n\n\u003Ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/aTsri2PvSis\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen>\u003C/iframe>\n\n\n\nCan you craft the Rainbow Furnace and unlock its POWER? \n\n![Rainbow Furnace](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d6ff288fb90998a54369a29deaddea220a562352.png)\n\nGot any questions? Read the Wiki!\n\n \n\nVersion Status\n\n1.21.x: Active Development\n\n \n\nIron Furnaces should be compatible with most mods. \n\nIt has explicit compatibility with JEI and Project MMO.\n\n \n\nThe textures used from the Thermal Series are used with CoFH permission.\n\n \n\nChange log: [https://github.com/Qelifern/IronFurnacesNeoForge/blob/4.3.2/ifchangelog.txt](https://github.com/Qelifern/IronFurnacesNeoForge/blob/4.3.2/ifchangelog.txt)\n\n \n\nThis mod is open source and licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. It may be modified and used in any project, subject to the terms of the license.","2024-02-27T03:07:39.567125Z","2026-04-07T07:49:24.230203Z","2024-02-28T09:28:11.024999Z","2024-03-04T15:36:31.181472Z",{"id":32002,"name":32003,"url":3589},"Apache-2.0","Apache License 2.0",7700855,222,[279,288],[],[354,385],[32010,32011,32012,32013,32014,32015,32016,32017,32018,32019,32020,32021,32022],"ZcpwCwXC","yl3xmztN","fGEswUMR","kMzbsKeN","6jCrW5fX","JXiy5rDh","l6USRdvK","U2oiDK7a","MfRtaT6s","JlMfdPxK","BX6fcXBb","WZ25JeYB","KHAcRQwi","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPlaLxD1/8788274b9d09dba7bfc99b29d9d0a708ba5e4e74.png","https://github.com/Qelifern/IronFurnaces/issues","https://github.com/Qelifern/IronFurnaces","https://github.com/Qelifern/IronFurnaces/wiki",[],[32029,32033,32036],{"url":32030,"raw_url":32031,"featured":439,"title":3589,"description":3589,"created":32032,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPlaLxD1/images/02fdb5c4ea9c731707467fa87873983cf066f552_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPlaLxD1/images/02fdb5c4ea9c731707467fa87873983cf066f552.png","2024-02-27T03:18:45.602288Z",{"url":32034,"raw_url":32034,"featured":439,"title":3589,"description":3589,"created":32035,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPlaLxD1/images/7ec6d7a03e7683e3b11f43f2a56dbdbcef4dbb7b.png","2024-03-04T15:39:01.954820Z",{"url":32037,"raw_url":32037,"featured":439,"title":3589,"description":3589,"created":32038,"ordering":29985},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPlaLxD1/images/d9b32babfc2cdd96080590be0352fbadfa49130a.png","2024-03-04T15:38:43.236497Z",3552822,"aAa8qksb",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":30059,"game_versions":32042,"id":32043,"slug":32044,"project_type":31,"team":32045,"organization":3589,"title":32046,"description":32047,"body":32048,"body_url":3589,"published":32049,"updated":32050,"approved":32051,"queued":32052,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":32053,"downloads":32054,"followers":30618,"categories":32055,"additional_categories":32056,"loaders":32057,"versions":32058,"icon_url":32060,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":32061,"gallery":32064,"color":32070,"thread_id":32071,"monetization_status":30057},[787],"yPwlu4sF","hotbar-scrolling-sound","r9ykqkMK","Hotbar Scrolling Sound","This client-sided mod for Fabric plays a small \"tick\" sound, when you switch to another slot in your Hotbar.","**⚠️IMPORTANT⚠️**\n\nThis mod requires [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api).\n\n\u003Chr>\n\n**Mod Description**\n\n_Ever thought that when switching slots of your hot bar, a sound should play? Well, you came to the right place!_\n\n**Hotbar Scrolling Sound** is a client-sided only Minecraft mod for the **Fabric Loader**, that plays a little \"tick\" sound, when switching slots of your hotbar. The mod is configurable with **2** commands that the mod adds:\n\n1. /togglehotbarscrollingsound \u003C**ENABLED**|**DISABLED**>\n2. /hotbarsounds:scrollingvolume \u003C**scrollingVolume**> (Min: 0.0, Max: 2.0)\n\nExample usage for command No.**1**:\n\n\u003Cblockquote>\n  /togglehotbarscrollingsound ENABLED\n\u003C/blockquote>\n\n\nExample usage for command No.**2**:\n\n\u003Cblockquote>\n  /hotbarsounds:scrollingvolume 0.5  \n\u003C/blockquote>\n\nFor reference of the mod, please play the **Mod Demonstration Video** below.\n\n\u003Chr>\n\n**Mod Demonstration Video**\n\n\u003Ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/hhdcwuiATwY\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen>\u003C/iframe>\n\n\u003Chr>\n\n**Why Download?**\n\nThis mod plays a sound to the player when switching Hotbar slots, **which is a missing UI sound**. It also **increases the Q.O.L** (Quality of Life), of Minecraft.\n\n\u003Chr>\n\n**Donation**\n\nIf you like my work, and would like support me, then please consider to donate **[here](https://paypal.com/paypalme/EdwardKhrabrov)** (or with another link on the side bar, under \"Links\").","2025-01-07T05:56:26.516338Z","2025-01-07T17:41:16.300979Z","2025-01-13T04:23:25.551310Z","2025-01-09T03:03:09.406637Z",{"id":29982,"name":29983,"url":3589},265,[100,134],[],[346],[32059],"qFWFFqb3","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPwlu4sF/d6233290738546a2de9d6054b12e3e9a4c7b70d6_96.webp",[32062],{"id":3140,"platform":31465,"url":32063},"https://paypal.com/paypalme/EdwardKhrabrov",[32065],{"url":32066,"raw_url":32066,"featured":846,"title":32067,"description":32068,"created":32069,"ordering":29985},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPwlu4sF/images/d6233290738546a2de9d6054b12e3e9a4c7b70d6.png","Icon","This image is simply his mod's in-game icon.","2025-01-07T17:22:23.825424Z",8168699,"hWjCf18v",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":32073,"id":32074,"slug":32075,"project_type":31,"team":32076,"organization":3589,"title":32077,"description":32078,"body":32079,"body_url":3589,"published":32080,"updated":32081,"approved":32082,"queued":32083,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":32084,"downloads":32085,"followers":30034,"categories":32086,"additional_categories":32087,"loaders":32088,"versions":32089,"icon_url":32091,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":32092,"donation_urls":32093,"gallery":32094,"color":32095,"thread_id":32096,"monetization_status":30057},[1040],"yPh45hnJ","dungeons-revamped","UtkOMYeu","dungeons revamped","minecraft dungeons artifacts and weaponry but best of all the staff of dominance","**dependencies: https://modrinth.com/mod/irons-spells-n-spellbooks/version/1.20.1-3.4.0.9\nhttps://modrinth.com/mod/threetag-palladium/version/4.2.4+1.20.1-forge**\n\nthis mod is focused around minecraft dungeon's artifacts with the highlight the orb of dominance, the staff of dominance and the orb fragments used to craft the orb which are found in temples around the world 2 in the overworld, 1 in the nether and 1 in the end. For the alpha version only the orb of dominance, staff of dominance and orb's fragments are available.(when i make the yt video i am gonna tag it in the description)\n","2025-08-01T13:59:37.531101Z","2025-08-01T14:23:20.134639Z","2025-08-03T20:53:25.519523Z","2025-08-01T14:29:40.275631Z",{"id":30072,"name":10,"url":3589},287,[30,115,171],[],[354],[32090],"hMzMdBwe","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPh45hnJ/79d43f47f3bdce99c3c68cb1c0393b8577f9fdc9_96.webp","https://discord.gg/cRq2ta7q",[],[],12367800,"4BeLesrS",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":32098,"id":32099,"slug":32100,"project_type":34,"team":32101,"organization":3589,"title":32100,"description":32102,"body":32103,"body_url":3589,"published":32104,"updated":32105,"approved":32106,"queued":32107,"status":29957,"requested_status":29960,"moderator_message":3589,"license":32108,"downloads":32109,"followers":30034,"categories":32110,"additional_categories":32111,"loaders":32112,"versions":32113,"icon_url":32124,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":32125,"gallery":32126,"color":32142,"thread_id":32143,"monetization_status":30057},[1040],"yPDOUFbV","12w02a","G8Nx8u2L","A modpack recreating a lost 1.1 snapshot, with (most) of it's features intact.","# Minecraft 12w02a\nA while back, a Mojang employee posted what seemed to be a lost snapshot version of 1.1. Strangely, any attempts I made to reupload the .jar file failed, so this pack was made to recreate the version using assets pulled from the jar file.\n\n_There's something out there..._\n\n![house](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fb4bc41adc92dd92991d48f688042b19e4673e83.png)\n\n# Modpack Details\n**DON'T CLICK UNLESS YOU'VE PLAYED THE PACK ALREADY!** It's best if you go in without any prior knowledge of what it has, trust me.\n\u003Cdetails>\n\u003Csummary>SPOILERS\u003C/summary>\nThis pack pretty much completely reverts the game back to 1.1. This means no extra wood types other than Oak wood, early sounds, no new mobs, etc. While some modern minecraft stuff is still included (the Mace, ancient cities, etc.) most have been stripped back for the sake of accuracy.\nThis also means skins & capes will NOT work. You will play as Steve and you will like it.\n\nThis pack also includes a bunch of QOL features I thought should've been in the game by now, such as little animations whenever you pick up items in the inventory, faster ladders, durability percentage tooltip, etc.\n\n----\nAlso **THIS IS A HORROR PACK**. This pack attempts to creep you out as you play, through weird structures, events, and more. Be warned. \n\u003C/details>\n","2025-09-15T01:46:53.160373Z","2026-02-23T20:01:41.347807Z","2025-12-19T19:49:26.436645Z","2025-12-13T18:08:46.254971Z",{"id":30072,"name":10,"url":3589},257,[30,77],[],[385],[32114,32115,32116,32117,32118,32119,32120,32121,32122,32123],"4f3CfFQm","xiuPWA9N","iqUcwiKD","sAfHwVru","Uyj0oDcr","13XGdCqx","CQbDdqCZ","qucwQOCh","yGrCt4tx","Lw4qReB5","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPDOUFbV/71a6756bcfd2edbb9d56a11cc5b0034ec93e36f7_96.webp",[],[32127,32133,32137],{"url":32128,"raw_url":32129,"featured":846,"title":32130,"description":32131,"created":32132,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPDOUFbV/images/1a0a02eb3c58eb676fe74e824be461333b9f31db_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPDOUFbV/images/1a0a02eb3c58eb676fe74e824be461333b9f31db.png","Blog Post","Blog post about the lost update, one of the few mentions of it online left.","2025-12-15T02:28:10.915897Z",{"url":32134,"raw_url":32135,"featured":439,"title":3589,"description":3589,"created":32136,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPDOUFbV/images/3248deb575ebdf49040899582842c3e4d18bb640_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPDOUFbV/images/3248deb575ebdf49040899582842c3e4d18bb640.png","2025-12-13T16:40:27.547223Z",{"url":32138,"raw_url":32139,"featured":439,"title":32140,"description":3589,"created":32141,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPDOUFbV/images/a1dfbf02bb78f98053a4443817df1b5306f1dcd7_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPDOUFbV/images/a1dfbf02bb78f98053a4443817df1b5306f1dcd7.png","Giants","2025-12-13T16:40:44.098981Z",1513239,"6HPP0aUd",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":30059,"game_versions":32145,"id":32146,"slug":32147,"project_type":31,"team":32148,"organization":3589,"title":32149,"description":32150,"body":32151,"body_url":3589,"published":32152,"updated":32153,"approved":32154,"queued":32155,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":32156,"downloads":32157,"followers":30158,"categories":32158,"additional_categories":32159,"loaders":32160,"versions":32161,"icon_url":32167,"issues_url":32168,"source_url":32169,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":32170,"gallery":32171,"color":32176,"thread_id":32177,"monetization_status":30057},[1040],"yPuKst0V","elytra-durability-indicator","uAajyr0S","Elytra Durability Indicator","Stylishly render your elytra durability under your crosshair!","This is a very simple mod that, when you have an elytra on, renders a small indicator of your elytra's durability below your crosshair. \n\n\nMod originally made for the upcoming modpack Vampires Strikes Back.\n\n![GUI](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/955d265532122dac1f5d377b3d675b2cdca57ccf.png)\n\n\n\n\nAll the bar values (offsets, sizes, bar color) are configurable in the mod's client config.\nThe elytra icon can be modified with a texture pack in modid:textures/gui/elytra_icon, but can only be 16x16","2025-10-21T01:53:00.599380Z","2025-10-28T02:18:11.096449Z","2025-10-22T04:13:25.697121Z","2025-10-21T03:06:44.637060Z",{"id":32002,"name":32003,"url":3589},1187,[115,175,303],[297],[354],[32162,32163,32164,32165,32166],"gx68C8qT","QSrVTGxO","I9ufRjcH","hRD5qdIq","uzuNHWaf","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPuKst0V/4a05bfb28cf6b60a815f08785c6e00d9e3510838.png","https://github.com/HoshinOFW/Elytra-Durability-Indicator/issues","https://github.com/HoshinOFW/Elytra-Durability-Indicator",[],[32172],{"url":32173,"raw_url":32173,"featured":439,"title":32174,"description":3589,"created":32175,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPuKst0V/images/955d265532122dac1f5d377b3d675b2cdca57ccf.png","In-game view","2025-10-21T02:24:08.519048Z",11316408,"M04sn98N",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":32179,"id":32180,"slug":32181,"project_type":31,"team":32182,"organization":3589,"title":32183,"description":32184,"body":32185,"body_url":3589,"published":32186,"updated":32187,"approved":32188,"queued":32189,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":32190,"downloads":32191,"followers":32192,"categories":32193,"additional_categories":32194,"loaders":32195,"versions":32196,"icon_url":32255,"issues_url":32256,"source_url":32257,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":32258,"gallery":32259,"color":32265,"thread_id":32266,"monetization_status":30057},[2084,1310,1295,1268,1211,1178,1169,1133,1094,1046,1040,1007,965,959,887,881,844,838,790,787,757,709,667,658,652,607,601,556],"yPdzmBAj","fox-friend","AizaMKjS","Fox Friend","Make the fox no longer stay away from you and be able to tame it.","About This Mod:\n- Normally foxes run away when players approach - this mod removes that fear mechanic.\n- In version 6.0+, feeding a fox a Apple will make it follow you. Right-clicking or exiting the game will make it wait in place.\n- Foxes regenerate health when eating autonomously.\n- Crouch + Right-click allows the owner to change the item their fox is holding.\n\n- This mod can be added to modpacks.\n\n1.12.2 Version:\n- Backported foxes (added foxes to 1.12.2).\n- Breed with carrots, beetroots, or items with \"berries\" in their registry name.\n- Supports picking sweet berries from the \"Future MC\" mod.\n\n# \nCompatibility:\n- Fabric-1.0 version should theoretically work with all versions above 1.18.","2025-03-29T08:30:28.789675Z","2026-03-22T22:30:50.607647Z","2025-03-31T08:27:45.226249Z","2025-03-29T08:45:39.399132Z",{"id":2