s":32281,"followers":32282,"categories":32283,"additional_categories":32284,"loaders":32285,"versions":32286,"icon_url":32293,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":32294,"donation_urls":32295,"gallery":32296,"color":32319,"thread_id":32320,"monetization_status":30057},[556],"yPZfYNcX","betterbundlesreimagined","sf5sqpNJ","2z7VVD7G","Better Bundles Reimagined","Vanilla-Type Mod : Upgrade bundles with increased storage and QOL tweaks.","![Better Bundles Reimagined Title Image](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/986c28b5ce0548433670cab4261bbbbd597e9a68.png)\n\n![BundlesDisplay](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/73cc1148b7a551941661b56ddcc2149131f9ac20.png)\n\n# Description  \nThis mod lets you upgrade bundles as you progress, **increasing their storage capacity**. It also adds some **quality-of-life (QOL) improvements** to bundles. Think of it as a shulker box you can upgrade - and a netherite bundle that is indestructible to lava and fire!\n\n# Info  \n- Bundle // **1 stack (64)**  \n- Iron Bundle // **4 stacks (256)**  \n- Gold Bundle // **8 stacks (512)**  \n- Diamond Bundle // **12 stacks (768)**  \n- Netherite Bundle // **16 stacks (1,024)**  \n\n# Crafting Recipes  \n\n![Iron Bundle](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/541033b056e581be188ed7572fd35d2c52895dd5.png)  \n![Gold Bundle](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2d1c5c6fb1c25bfc46d5fccc58ba5de3556d83c1.png)  \n![Diamond Bundle](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9c02c20d4a1d750430103881cd071e3607477736.png)    \n![Netherite Bundle](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e044094e058833ede5c583363ab938d7567654f2.png)\n\nPlease report any bugs, issues, or suggestions on our Discord!\n\n# Upcoming Features\n- All color variants  \n\n______________________________________________________________________________________________\n\n[![Playable on Modrinth](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e002e2b19cf4a0cf075dfc284b8db81f92257bc0.png)](https://modrinth.com/mod/betterbundlesreimagined)\n","2025-03-15T01:12:02.986905Z","2026-03-11T22:36:19.781047Z","2026-02-07T23:41:33.356168Z","2026-02-07T22:36:45.341653Z",{"id":30072,"name":10,"url":3589},1751,14,[211,279,303],[],[346],[32287,32288,32289,32290,32291,32292],"DzTWfezV","jJYU6YwZ","7qzNV7Ph","xJUC9EZh","nC8iZULJ","bSQ9PB4a","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPZfYNcX/f12d0c6272602595cc4195a65831fe86695b5b6b_96.webp","https://discord.gg/Vjw5pukKPt",[],[32297,32303,32307,32311,32315],{"url":32298,"raw_url":32299,"featured":846,"title":32300,"description":3589,"created":32301,"ordering":32302},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPZfYNcX/images/f12d0c6272602595cc4195a65831fe86695b5b6b_350.webp","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPZfYNcX/images/f12d0c6272602595cc4195a65831fe86695b5b6b.png","Better Bundles Reimagined Logo","2026-02-23T18:12:41.293545Z",-1,{"url":32304,"raw_url":32304,"featured":439,"title":32305,"description":3589,"created":32306,"ordering":29985},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPZfYNcX/images/46a5db3b12213c54148e451333b00657fae51d38.png","Iron Bundle Recipe","2026-02-23T18:17:16.182683Z",{"url":32308,"raw_url":32308,"featured":439,"title":32309,"description":3589,"created":32310,"ordering":29985},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPZfYNcX/images/57bb6d01fa7472df09da4a8c998aa74e606ce9be.png","Gold Bundle Recipe","2026-02-23T18:17:30.237690Z",{"url":32312,"raw_url":32312,"featured":439,"title":32313,"description":3589,"created":32314,"ordering":30039},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPZfYNcX/images/a2cb125c5a08e3040015e0226e775c5e4cd7f9d4.png","Diamond Bundle Recipe","2026-02-23T18:17:36.519441Z",{"url":32316,"raw_url":32316,"featured":439,"title":32317,"description":3589,"created":32318,"ordering":30044},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPZfYNcX/images/92ccd39c5e9f2d6acd6822bc0ecea4f59a15eb99.png","Netherite Bundle Recipe ","2026-02-23T18:19:30.997746Z",6173991,"Ms9RZGwv",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":32322,"id":32323,"slug":32324,"project_type":31,"team":32325,"organization":3589,"title":32326,"description":32327,"body":32328,"body_url":3589,"published":32329,"updated":32330,"approved":32331,"queued":32332,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":32333,"downloads":30755,"followers":29985,"categories":32334,"additional_categories":32335,"loaders":32336,"versions":32337,"icon_url":32344,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":32345,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":32346,"donation_urls":32347,"gallery":32348,"color":32352,"thread_id":32353,"monetization_status":30057},[1040,1007,965,959,887,881],"yPOr9qEt","jalnyrs-weaponary","j2F5rkG4","Jalnyr's Weaponary","A mod that adds many new and interesting weapons","This mod adds tons of new and interesting weapons with varying power. \nFor now there is three weapons and few new resources:\n- Froststeel Sword\n- Froststeel Greatsword\n- Froststeel DualSword\n- Froststeel Katana\n- Froststeel Knife\n- Froststeel Spear\n- Flamemetal Sword\n- Flamemetal Katana\n- Flamemetal Knife\n- Flamemetal Spear\n\nThis mod also adds a new type of wood: The Frozen wood\nFrozen trees spawn in cold biomes and sticks crafted from them can be used to craft the froststeel weapons.\nThere is two new metals that can be found underground. They are:\n- Froststeel\n- Flamemetal\nYou can use these metals to craft some powerful weapons that deal more damage than netherite.\n\nThe items have custom models and high quality textures\n[![bisecthosting](https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Fallen_World/MP_FallenWorld_promo.webp)](https://www.bisecthosting.com/jalnyr?r=jalnyrsweaponarymodrinth)","2026-05-04T18:48:14.509597Z","2026-05-30T18:24:15.649006Z","2026-05-25T23:44:41.549027Z","2026-05-22T13:02:54.862531Z",{"id":29982,"name":29983,"url":3589},[30,115],[],[354],[32338,32339,32340,32341,32342,32343],"KVf1V8KR","bT9LrRi9","zJyyioSv","1Y4WoS58","IuV9PgQ8","t49AHfhF","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPOr9qEt/fdc2bf19492410f851e2ca27d0ad2624b9a6cb6c.png","https://github.com/jalnyr256/Jalnyrs_weponary","https://discord.gg/zsfbRUk9WJ",[],[32349],{"url":32350,"raw_url":32350,"featured":439,"title":3589,"description":3589,"created":32351,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPOr9qEt/images/6dcefe1baa849a1ee01273e538fd07cd219ec598.png","2026-05-04T18:49:29.590697Z",263172,"dogt4TLH",{"client_side":30059,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":32355,"id":32356,"slug":32357,"project_type":31,"team":32358,"organization":32359,"title":32360,"description":32361,"body":32362,"body_url":3589,"published":32363,"updated":32364,"approved":32365,"queued":32366,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":32367,"downloads":32368,"followers":30001,"categories":32369,"additional_categories":32370,"loaders":32371,"versions":32372,"icon_url":32375,"issues_url":32376,"source_url":32377,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":32378,"donation_urls":32379,"gallery":32380,"color":32392,"thread_id":32393,"monetization_status":30057},[1046,1040,1007,965,959,887,881,844,838,790,787,757,709,667,658,652,607,601,556],"yOnJES9g","asyncenchantlimiter","7H99ViGG","RWRKSPdC","async enchantlimiter","Optimized enchantment limiter for Folia and Paper. Enforce level limits across anvils, villagers, and loot without main-thread lag.","**AsyncEnchantLimiter | High-Performance Enchantment Enforcement**\n\n**Built for Folia & modern Paper servers - No more lag from over-enchanted items.**\n\n![banner](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/45c7bb4b6dcc75ec701cea28e4c1961328ce0fe3.png)\n\nAsyncEnchantLimiter is a powerful plugin that prevents players from utilizing items with enchantments exceeding defined limits. Engineered from the ground up for speed, it is specifically designed for Folia and high-performance Paper environments where traditional limiters often cause thread contention or TPS drops.\n\n![sparkprofiler](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/095bfb91304be767e30b7e214a6acbd4e1e9f193.png)\n\n---\n\n## Technical Features\n\n**Intuitive Management Interface**\nManage every enchantment limit directly in-game. The paginated GUI ensures changes stay synchronized across the server instantly.\n\n![gui](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f0e8f65a867eda04376a152209b800d3cf912483.png)\n\n**Streamlined Notifications**\nNo chat spam. Players receive a single, clean notification when an item is downgraded, ensuring they understand the enforcement without cluttering their view.\n\n![blocked](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/922034be217dd43362e772c98b455c4ec21ddcb1.png)\n\n---\n\n## Core Advantages\n\n- **Native Folia Support**: Fully compatible with Folia's region scheduler, ensuring thread-safe operations.\n- **Asynchronous Processing**: Heavy lifting—such as file I/O and inventory scanning—is offloaded from the main thread to maintain 20.0 TPS.\n- **Ubiquitous Enforcement**: Monitors item interaction across hold, click, equip, and trade events.\n- **Villager Trade Correction**: Automatically scans and fixes illegal enchantment levels in villager trades upon generation.\n- **Modern Aesthetic**: Features a clean pink and gray theme with custom small-caps typography for a premium look.\n\n## Documentation\n\n**Control & Utility**\n- **Custom Max Levels**: Define specific caps for every enchantment (e.g., Sharpness 5, Protection 4).\n- **Anvil Intelligence**: Blocks illegal combinations at the source.\n- **Global Loot Scanning**: Automatically validates items from fishing, mob drops, and world chests.\n- **Bypass Permissions**: Grant specific groups the ability to exceed limits for testing or special roles.\n\n**Command Registry**\n\n| Command | Alias | Description | Permission |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `/enchantlimiter` | `/el` | Open the main menu. | `enchantlimiter.admin` |\n| `/el gui` | | Open the limit editor. | `enchantlimiter.admin` |\n| `/el reload` | | Reload all configs. | `enchantlimiter.admin` |\n\n## Getting Started\n\nDrop the JAR into your plugins folder and restart. The configuration is designed for readability and quick adjustments:\n\n```yaml\nsettings:\n  enforce-on-hold: true    # Check items as players hold them\n  fix-villager-trades: true # Auto-fix broken villager trades\n  notify-player: true      # Let players know when an item is fixed\n  silent-mode: false       # Set to true to fix items without any messages\nlimits:\n  sharpness: 5\n  efficiency: 5\n  protection: 4\n","2026-02-09T20:50:17.398930Z","2026-02-09T21:24:19.919049Z","2026-02-11T01:36:05.115376Z","2026-02-09T21:26:01.689198Z",{"id":29982,"name":29983,"url":3589},167,[115,134,211],[303],[350,401,405],[32373,32374],"upWD6ciA","ZRpiaCfs","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOnJES9g/29cdea269d270ca4ba2c08c948c3aea23dfb5b3c_96.webp","https://github.com/Jan1k1/asyncEnchantLimiter/issues","https://github.com/Jan1k1/asyncEnchantLimiter","https://discord.gg/9vRHMFfAkn",[],[32381,32385,32389],{"url":32382,"raw_url":32382,"featured":439,"title":32383,"description":3589,"created":32384,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOnJES9g/images/29cdea269d270ca4ba2c08c948c3aea23dfb5b3c.png","pfp","2026-02-09T21:25:39.165526Z",{"url":32386,"raw_url":32386,"featured":439,"title":32387,"description":3589,"created":32388,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOnJES9g/images/922034be217dd43362e772c98b455c4ec21ddcb1.png","message","2026-02-09T21:25:49.874541Z",{"url":32390,"raw_url":32390,"featured":439,"title":139,"description":3589,"created":32391,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yOnJES9g/images/f0e8f65a867eda04376a152209b800d3cf912483.png","2026-02-09T21:25:59.130649Z",15379946,"cHpkV3tG",{"client_side":29969,"server_side":30059,"game_versions":32395,"id":32396,"slug":32397,"project_type":31,"team":32398,"organization":3589,"title":32399,"description":32400,"body":32401,"body_url":3589,"published":32402,"updated":32403,"approved":32404,"queued":32405,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":32406,"downloads":32407,"followers":30039,"categories":32408,"additional_categories":32409,"loaders":32410,"versions":32411,"icon_url":32427,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":3589,"donation_urls":32428,"gallery":32429,"color":32440,"thread_id":32441,"monetization_status":30057},[1040,1007,965,959,887,881],"yPuniOak","goetyladder","lL2xApTF","Goety:Ladder","An auxiliary module for the Wicked Witchcraft system, designed to expand upon the core content of Wicked Witchcraft while introducing additional original content.","Goety: Ladder is an add-on mod for Goety, designed to expand the base game's content and introduce original elements. Future updates will include approximately 4 content additions:)\n\nMore Crystals: Adds advanced crystals derived from Goety\n\nMore Rituals: Introduces additional ritual types for item synthesis\n\nMore Minions: Adds original minions for player interaction\n\nMore Structure Creatures: Expands with more ruins and creatures to explore and challenge\n\nThis mod offers Goety players a wider variety of choices while maintaining seamless integration with the original style. Future updates will continuously enrich your magical experience with more original content and mechanics!","2026-02-16T20:55:16.043185Z","2026-05-25T16:19:16.531465Z","2026-02-18T01:12:41.032195Z","2026-02-17T08:47:34.070639Z",{"id":30072,"name":10,"url":3589},34613,[171],[30,115],[354],[32412,32413,32414,32415,32416,32417,32418,32419,32420,32421,32422,32423,32424,32425,32426],"picoUHcB","IO69FqqU","MH2fs1un","INKAW2mB","JxP8IvKz","6R42sFCj","O2o1Stqq","kLXxNBQZ","NzjzF4Tz","g4Ex0HLo","C7A5LfvX","wDQjftnv","kuPBOC3M","g7ODclnA","yRcyetuG","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPuniOak/4ce130507b5f350ade051ce499e051a26067d763.png",[],[32430,32435],{"url":32431,"raw_url":32431,"featured":439,"title":32432,"description":32433,"created":32434,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPuniOak/images/170668a508ef9eb08cd7fc7decbb1742775dbb82.png","目前聚晶 (Now Foucs)","有3个虚空系，和一个魔法系\n(There are three void-based classes and one magic-based class.)","2026-02-16T21:10:37.206051Z",{"url":32436,"raw_url":32436,"featured":439,"title":32437,"description":32438,"created":32439,"ordering":30001},"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPuniOak/images/bceac3f52f7448ed228d398031fc42b02a8695d5.png","goety:ladder","这是一个goety的附属模组\n(This is a Goety add-on module.)\n本模组的定位是对goety原内容的扩充以及其他原创内容(This mod is positioned as an expansion of the original Goety content alongside other original content.)\n","2026-02-16T21:09:21.600448Z",10171928,"x1LbLhMk",{"client_side":30059,"server_side":29969,"game_versions":32443,"id":32444,"slug":32445,"project_type":31,"team":32446,"organization":3589,"title":32447,"description":32448,"body":32449,"body_url":3589,"published":32450,"updated":32451,"approved":32452,"queued":32453,"status":29957,"requested_status":29957,"moderator_message":3589,"license":32454,"downloads":32455,"followers":29985,"categories":32456,"additional_categories":32457,"loaders":32458,"versions":32459,"icon_url":32462,"issues_url":3589,"source_url":3589,"wiki_url":3589,"discord_url":32463,"donation_urls":32464,"gallery":32465,"color":32501,"thread_id":32502,"monetization_status":30057},[652],"yPujSn0L","unbentrockstructures","bBHMCx4Y","Unbentrock's simple structures","This mod adds a couple of structures including a nice starter house and a forest look out tower","\u003Cdiv align=\"center\">\n\n\u003Ch2 style=\"color: #C0392B;\">⚠️ THIS MOD IS A WORK IN PROGRESS\u003C/h2>\n\n\u003Ch1 style=\"color: #2ECC71;\">🏠 Simple Starter House\u003C/h1>\n\u003Cspan style=\"font-family: monospace; color: #7F8C8D;\">\u003Ci>A lightweight, immersive structure mod fully vanilla friendly.\u003C/i>\u003C/span>\n\n\u003Chr>\n\n\u003C/div>\n\n\u003Ch3 style=\"color: #3498DB;\">📜 About the Mod\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>This mod adds a cozy, pre-built \u003Cb>Starter House\u003C/b> near your spawn point. It provides a functional head-start without breaking the vanilla progression.\u003C/p>\n\n\u003Cul>\n  \u003Cli>\u003Cb>🌿 Starter Farm:\u003C/b> A small plot of crops to secure your first meals.\u003C/li>\n  \u003Cli>\u003Cb>📦 Loot Chest:\u003C/b> Contains basic essentials to help you survive the first night.\u003C/li>\n  \u003Cli>\u003Cb>📍 Natural Spawning:\u003C/b> Found within \u003Cfont color=\"#E67E22\">\u003Cb>5 to 20 chunks\u003C/b>\u003C/font> of world spawn.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\n\u003Ch3 style=\"color: #27AE60;\">🌲 The Scout Update (v1.1.0)\u003C/h3>\n\u003Ch4 style=\"color: #2ECC71;\">🔭 New Feature: Forest Lookout Tower\u003C/h4>\n\u003Cul>\n  \u003Cli>\u003Cb>\u003Cspan style=\"color: #27AE60;\">New Structure:\u003C/span>\u003C/b> High-altitude wooden towers now generate deep within \u003Cb>Forest\u003C/b>, \u003Cb>Birch Forest\u003C/b>, and \u003Cb>Taiga\u003C/b> biomes.\u003C/li>\n  \u003Cli>\u003Cb>\u003Cspan style=\"color: #F1C40F;\">Tower Loot:\u003C/span>\u003C/b> Reach the top to find scout-themed supplies, including spyglasses and survival gear.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\n\u003Ch4 style=\"color: #3498DB;\">🏰 Improvements & Fixes\u003C/h4>\n\u003Cul>\n  \u003Cli>\u003Cb>\u003Cspan style=\"color: #F39C12;\">Perfect Grounding:\u003C/span>\u003C/b> The starter house now \u003Cb>sinks correctly\u003C/b> into the terrain. No more floating boxes or gaps under the floorboards!\u003C/li>\n  \u003Cli>\u003Cb>\u003Cspan style=\"color: #F39C12;\">Natural Curves:\u003C/span>\u003C/b> The hills now blend smoothly to meet your front door, removing the \"ugly walls\" on hillsides.\u003C/li>\n  \u003Cli>\u003Cb>\u003Cspan style=\"color: #E74C3C;\">Waterproofing:\u003C/span>\u003C/b> Structures will no longer generate in the middle of lakes or rivers.\u003C/li>\n  \u003Cli>\u003Cb>\u003Cspan style=\"color: #E74C3C;\">Forest Cleanup:\u003C/span>\u003C/b> Fixed trees being cut in half; buildings now properly clear out leaves and wood upon spawning.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\n\u003Ch4 style=\"color: #9B59B6;\">🕵️ SECRETS...\u003C/h4>\n\u003Cdiv style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 5px solid #9B59B6;\">\n  \u003Cp style=\"color: #ecf0f1; margin: 0;\">\u003Cb>The starter house holds a dark secret... can you find it?\u003C/b>\u003C/p>\n\u003C/div>\n\n\u003Chr>\n\n\u003Ch3 style=\"color: #3498DB;\">🔍 How to Find It\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>These structures generate naturally, but you can locate them instantly with \u003Cb>Cheats\u003C/b> enabled:\u003C/p>\n\n\u003Ccode> /locate structure testing:starter_house \u003C/code>\n\u003Cbr>\n\u003Ccode> /locate structure testing:lookout_tower \u003C/code>\n\n\u003Chr>\n\n\u003Ch3 style=\"color: #C0392B;\">⚠️ CRITICAL REQUIREMENT\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cspan style=\"color: #A93226;\">\u003Cb>\u003Ci>LATEST FABRIC LOADER REQUIRED FOR ALL VERSIONS\u003C/i>\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\n\n\u003Cblockquote>\u003Cfont color=\"#7F8C8D\">\u003Ci>Note: Using an outdated Fabric Loader may result in \"Incompatible Mod\" errors or crashes on startup.\u003C/i>\u003C/font>\u003C/blockquote>\n\n\u003Chr>\n\n\u003Ch3 style=\"color: #9B59B6;\">💬 Community & Support\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>Have a bug report or a suggestion for a new structure? We'd love to hear it!\u003C/p>\n\n\u003Cp>\u003Cb>\u003Ca href=\"https://discord.gg/cQDCNJbspS\" style=\"color: #5865F2;\">Join our Discord Community\u003C/a>\u003C/b>\u003C/p>\n\n\u003Cdiv align=\"center\">\n\u003Cfont size=\"2\" color=\"#BDC3C7\">\u003Ci>Mod Version: 1.1.0 | Compatible with latest Fabric\u003C/i>\u003C/font>\n\u003C/div>\n","2026-03-23T08:54:45.948670Z","2026-03-24T23:50:14.478218Z","2026-04-20T02:01:38.021759Z","2026-04-06T23:09:10.638711Z",{"id":30072,"name":10,"url":3589},22,[100],[30,303],[346],[32460,32461],"lyABXQ2D","wa5Fhpe1","https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yPujSn0L/a4672a9937f0d85419540f68dab4278f8fec7bd9_96.webp","https://discord.gg/cQDCNJbspS",[],[32466,32471,32476,32481,32486,32491,32496],{"url":32467,"raw_url":32468,"featured":439,"title":32469